<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Purum Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">MARK Ning Amije Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ning Amije Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="imt">Chonglamsat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Mark dungjui a Chongkahoi</char> hi &lt;&lt;Chongtep ther (NT)&gt;&gt; sunga akaom jedetrubu minli ngai karra Jesu Christa ringkho jarra minchuna amin mu inkhat kha e. Hiwa jedetrubu minli ngaihi &lt;&lt;Gospel&gt;&gt; tia akinjet, hiwa hi Chongkahoi tina e. Hiwa Chongkahoi minli ngaihi Jesu Christa thiso nuk a Matthew, Mark, Luke le John ning anmije e. Chongkahoi minli ngai karra Mark ning amije hi akabong tak inkhat e. Hiwa chongkahoi minli ngai karra amasatak a amije e tia taksenna annei, hiwa hi Jesu christa aneiso kunuk kum somruk le ranga (65) le kum somsari (70) wenna amije e. Akising akathei katamtak ning hiwa jedetrubu hi Roman Christian ngaikha mothoknasik a Rome ria anmije e tia taksenna annei. Mark hi, John Mark tia num akinjet, amahi Tirle Paul le Barnabas le ankinroi bunga sinkotho inkhat e, takkha Pathien chong kiril ansena (Missionary sinna) Paul le Barnabas kha alei juitor mak jarra ama riming kha aleiminthet (Sintho 13:13) Takkha nuk achu Barnabas le kinroi a anleise bung (Sintho 15:37-39) Mark hi Peter le ankinlopthei sap inkhat e tia taksenna annei (1 Peter 5:13) Mark ning Jesu ringkho ngaihi amit tak a akumu mikha a imak inum, Mark ning Peter ringkho katam tak amu ajet ngai kha amije e tia akising akathei ning taksenna annei hiwahi Mark dungjui a chongkahoi aleida e. Hiwa chongkahoi hin, Mark ning thiemroi ringkho le Jesu ning ahekna nikho kutung sik jarra minchuna ngaikha akatam amije e.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asunga akaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mark ning hiwa jedetrubu jarra malarna chong (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Jesu ning Galilee a aleiom lai aleitho sin ngai jarra Mark ning kinchenna rilna anei (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-8:21">1:14--8:21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Jesu ning Jerusalem asena jarra Mark ning rilna anei (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 8:22-10:52">8:22--10:52</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Mark ning atorna amije khachu, Jesu ning Jerusalem aomlai ama thina le ring nokna jarra (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-16:8">11:1--16:8</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist chongril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Hiwahi Pathien Sapa Jesu Christa jarra Chongkahoi kha e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscripts alak a chu </char><char style="fq">Pathien Sapa</char> <char style="ft" closed="false">tihi kinchal mak. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Chongkachoipa Isaiah ning hi-ang hin aleimije:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">&lt;&lt;Pathien ning aleiti, &lt;Keining chongkaron ninma a kitir sik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">nin lampui akabol sik a.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Is 40:3</ref> </char>
    </note>Nerdiram a mi inkhat ning a-ong a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">&lt;Puma sik a lampui kha bolturu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Ama asena lampui kha mintunru!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Khawa soa John nerdiram a ahong kinlar, baptized athole kinroi a Pathien chong aleiril.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">John nerdiram a ahong kinlar, baptized athole kinroi a Pathien chong aleiril. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscripts alak a chu, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">John Baptist kha nerdiram ma aleisuok, Pathien chong aleiril.</char></note> &lt;&lt;Ninsetna ria heikir inlang baptized thoru, khan Pathien ning ninsetna anarangai mindam pesik,&gt;&gt; tia mipuideng aleiti. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Judea ramsunga le Jerusalem khopui a kaom mipui katamtak John chongril karangai sik a anleisuok. Anmani ning ansetna ngai anleirilsuok, khan Jordan Tuidung a anmani ngaikha John ning baptized aleitho.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Ren 1:8</ref> </char>
    </note> John ning satingkui mul a anbol ponder aleikei, akonga sawun kongkhit aleikhit, khan ama bak le in khachu khai le ramkhoining alei e. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Amaning mipuideng aleiminjet, &lt;&lt;Kei kunuk-a akahong sik miringpa khachu kei neknum akolok e, keichu ama kekokrui kinkunna kusutsik kutunga rohoi suokmang. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Keining nangni tui-a baptized kanatho, takkha amaning chu Ratha Kinthenga baptized anathosik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Baptize thona le mithemna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mat 3:13--4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Lk 3:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Khawasoli sotlei a Galilee ramsunga kaom Nazareth ria Jesu aheiwa khan John ning Jordan Tuidung a baptized aleitho. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Jesu ning tui ria aheisuokli, amaning marwan akinlong le Ratha ning achunga wathu anga ahong chum kha aleimu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aph 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Laa 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Is 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mk 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref></char></note>Khan marwan ria rasa inkhat ahonga, &lt;&lt;Nanghi kasapa mirit tak kha ni e. Nuchunga kumulung atai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Khawasoli Ratha ning amakha nerdiram a aleiminse, <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Khawa munkhan nisom-minli a-om a, Seitan ning aleimathem. Ramsa ngainum khana anlei om, takkha marwan tirle ngaining anhonga ama anleisen.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning ngakusur mi minli akoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Lk 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>John mikhumna sunga anda sonuk a, Jesu ning Galilee ase-a khan Pathien ria Chongkahoi ngaikha aleiril. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat 3:2</ref></char></note> &lt;&lt;Apha kha ahongtungjei, khan Pathien Rengram kha anaijei! Ninsetna ria mulung thul inlang Chongkahoi kha taksen ru!&gt;&gt; amaning aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Jesu ning Galilee tuitham pangteng alonlai, amaning ngakusur miring inni, Simon le ama naipa Andrew, lenna nga ansur aleimu. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Heiwaru kunuk nujuiru, khan keining mi kusur kinimin chusik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>khawalai takkhan anlen ngai anda a anmani ngaikha amale kinroia anleise.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Khan amaning akalakdet aseli alop unai inni, Zebedee naite ngai, James le John aleimu. Anmani ning rukuong sunga anlen ngaikha wor thanasik anleibol. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Khan Jesu ning anmani amuli, anmani kha aleikoi; khawa khan anmani ning anpa Zebedee le anlomroi ngaikha rukuong sunga anleida a Jesu nuk anleijui.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ratha kathamak akulut mi inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Lk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Jesu le ama thiemroi ngai Capernaum khopui a anheiwa, khan aban Jehudi ngai Serni ning Jesu ning synagogue aseli aleiminchu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note> Ama minchudan akajet mi rikip ning anleingak, ajarchu amakha Dan Oja ngaile leikin angmak, khawa nek a, amaning thotorna le kinroi a aleiminchu.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Khawapha takkhan ratha kathamak kulut mi inkhat synagogue aheilutli aleikheek, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>&lt;&lt;Angmi keini denga numunom, Nazareth Jesu? Keini kimin mang sik hin naom mi? Keining nang kanajet, Nangchu akintheng Pathien chongkaron kha ni e!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Jesu ning ratha deng chong ape, &lt;&lt;Omchenro, khan mipa deng ri heisuok ro!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Ratha kathamak khaning mipa kha ranaktak a aleimin nok a, khan aong-akheekli mipa deng ria aheisuokjei. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Mipui ngai ning anleingak, khawakhan anmani inkhatle inkhat ning ankinrakal, &lt;&lt;Hiwahi angmi? Hiwa minchuna hi athermi? Hiwa mipa hining ranak kaneitak a ratha kathamak ngaideng chongpena aleinei, khan anmani ning achong anleijui!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Kha angkhan kinrem tak a Galilee ram pumpui a Jesu chong ngaihi alei kinthang.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning mi katamtak amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Khawasoli Jesu le ama thiemroi ngai, James le John kinroi a, synagogue anmathaanna khan Simon le Andrew ngai inteng anleise. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Simon terpi kha ritun athoa phenchunga aleijal, Jesu aheitungli, khawanu chongkha amadeng anleiminjet. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Amaning khawanu deng ase a, akut ning akei dinga khan aleikeithei. Ritun ning khawanu kha amathanjei, khan numeisanu khaning anmani aleirajen.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Kini tasoa kholei ahongtung khan, mi ngaining akana le khori kulut rikip ngaikha Jesu deng anheiroi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Khawa khopui a kaom mipui rikip ngaikha khawa inma khan anleikinchun. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Jesu ning ri-rai kana mikatamtak ngaikha aleimindam khan khori katamtak alei holsuok. Khori ngaining amakha atumi ti anleijet, khawa jarra amaning khori ngaikha ite leiminrilmak.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galilee a Jesu chongril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Lk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Jingteng kini suokmak ma, Jesu athei-a inn kha aleimathaan jei. Khopui ria aheisuok a adai ngerna munkhan Pathien nina aleinei. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Takkha Simon le akinroipui ngaining ansuok a amakha anlei entok, <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>khan anmani ning ama anhong mu karkhan, amadeng anleiti, &lt;&lt;Mirikip ning nangkha ana entok.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Takkha Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Hiwa khosir khopang ria einining inkhat teng nisesik. Kei ning anmanideng chong kirilsik, khawa sik jarra kei kahong e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9:35</ref> </char>
    </note>Khawa jarra amaning Galilee ramrikip sunga aleise, synagogues a chong aleiril khan khori ngai alei holsuok.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning mi amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Chi kaomtak kaphar ri koron mi inkhat Jesu deng ahonga, akinkunna, nasenro tia nina aleinei. &lt;&lt;Nangning nana nompe inchu, kei nimintheng ro,&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei nimintheng ro: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiwa kaphar ri koron hining miringpa hi amintheng mak e tia anlei.</char></note> amaning aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Jesu deng minreng kha aleisip,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">minreng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscripts alak a chu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">arang </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tia aom</char></note> akut akadomma aleikotok. &lt;&lt;Keining konom jei, kintheng taro!&gt;&gt; tia aleiti. <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Khawalai takkhan kaphar ri koron kha mipa deng ria asuok a, khan amakha adamjei. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Khan Jesu ning chong kanger kha amadeng arilla amakha aleiminse, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Thm 14:1-32</ref> </char></note>hi-ang hin amadeng ati sonuk, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Rangairo, hiwahi atu deng khatnum rilmaro. Takkha thiempu deng wasero khan amaning nang na-en rase; khanchu mirikip deng nadamjei ti anjet nasik a, Moses chongpe dungjui a kinthoina kha hongtho ro.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Takkha mipa kha asuok a amun rikip a akasuok chong ngai kha aleiril minthang, khawa jarra, Jesu kha kinlar a khopui khan leisuok tor mak jei. Khawa nek a, mun kadai-ngera aseli awa-om, tak amun rikip a kaom mipui ngaining ama kolla anheiwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning alang kithipa amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Nikho alek soa Jesu ning Capernaum teng aleikirnok, khan inna khan ama aom jei ti chong alei kinthang. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Khawa jarra mi katamtak anheiwa a khawakhan tungnasik mun korok leiommak, inkhar ma kutunga amun leirok mak. Jesu ning Pathien chongkha anmanideng aleiril lai <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>pasal minli ngaining, alang kithipa inkhat Jesu deng anhei kadomma anhongpha. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Mipui antam hei jarra, mipa kha ama kolla heilutpui tormuk. Khawa jarra anmani ning Jesu omna inchung khan anmin wenga mipa kha ajalna pher le kinroi a anhei makhai minchum. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Anmani ngaikha kha-angtuk taksenna kha alei mukar, Jesu ning alang kithi mipa deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kasapa, nisetna ngaikha kanarangai mindam sojei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Khawa khan alei kin ong Dan oja alekning anbinga anleimindon, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>&lt;&lt;Kho-ongmo amaning hi-anghin achong tor e? Hiwa hichu Pathien chunga arildek e! Pathien amabei e setna karangai mindam torchu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Khawa laitak a Jesu ning anmani mulung mindon kha ajet a, anmanideng aleiti, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Angsikmi khawa angkhan nin mindon e?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/><char style="wj">Alang kithi mipa deng, &lt;Nisetna ngai kanarangai mindam pejei,&gt; ti a-imakli, &lt;Kinding inlang, napher kodom inlang, khan lonro, ti himo abeidet?&gt;</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/><char style="wj">Keining nangni deng niril minchenpe kate, Miring Sapa ning leithoichunga setna rangai mindam sik ranak anei.&gt;&gt;</char> khawa jarra amaning alang kithipa deng aleiti, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/><char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Keining nangdeng kiti, theiro, napher lei inlang, khan ni-inna setro!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Anmani ning an-inna an-omlai, mi pakha atheili, apher kha akadomma kinnot a mipui maikunga aleisuok. Anmani rikip ning anleingak a Pathien anleiminpak, &lt;&lt;Eini ning hiwa anghi lumungai phitmakmi!&gt;&gt; anleiti.<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning Levi akoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Jesu ning woikhat Galilee tuitham pangteng ahong kirnok a. Mipui katamtak amadeng anheiwa, khan amaning anmani kha minchuna aleiphut jei. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Ama kha-ang khan asena, amaning ramsel karathai, Alphaeus sapa Levi ramsel telna inna aleikin ong kha aleimu. Jesu ning amadeng, &lt;&lt;Nujuiro,&gt;&gt; aleiti. Levi ning akinding a anuk aleijui.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Khawa soa Jesu ning Levi inna bu aleibak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Levi inna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a-imakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(khawa kha, Jesu e) </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">inn.</char></note> Ramsel karathai katamtak ngaile setkoron ngaining Jesu nuk anleijui, khanna anmani katamtak ning amale athiemroi ngaikha bu anlei bakbung. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Dan Oja alek, Pharisees num aki e, Jesu ning ramsel karathai le setkoron ngaile bu anbak bungkha anleimu, khawa jarra ama thiemroi ngaideng anleirakal, &lt;&lt;Angsikmi amaning hiwa mi ngaile abakpui hi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Jesu ning hiwa ajet a anmanideng aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Akadam ngaisik chu thiempu rangaimak, takkha akana ngaisik bei arangai. Keining kahong hichu mikidik ngai akakoi kahong imong, takkha setkoron ngai akakoi kahong e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bungei jarra chongrakal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Rei inkhat a John Baptist anuk kujui ngai le Pharisees ngai ning bu anleingei. Mi alek ning Jesu deng anhonga anleirakal, &lt;&lt;John Baptist thiemroi ngaile Pharisees thiemroi ngaining bu an-ngei a, khan nang thiemroi ngaining angsik mi bu an-ngeimak e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Moiroina akahong khomol ngaikha bu baklei ankir sik ninti mi? Kha imak! Moipa ning anmanile aomlai sengchu, anmani ning kha-ang thononung. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Takkha moipa kha anmanideng ria anroi sik nikho alahongsik e, khawa karkhan anmani bu anlangei sik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>&lt;&lt;Atu inkhat ningnum pon kather awerkhat kha pon maro a kuthui delmuk, ajarchu pon kather awerkhat khaning pon maro kha akeirinna, akolok det a akinther sik. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Khanok chu atute ningnum sawun juhai muro a juther dangaimak, ajarchu ju khaning sawun juhai aminkoi sik, khan ju le sawun juhaikha akinmang sikjei. Khawa nek a, juther kha sawun juhaither a thunsik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehudi serni jarra rakalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Dan 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesu ning Jehudi Serni kini khan sang billa aleise. Ama thiemroi ngai ning amale anheiwalai, anmani ning sawui kha anlei richil. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Khawa jarra Pharisees ngaining Jesu deng anleiti, &lt;&lt;Enro, nang thiemroi ngai ning eini Dan le akintok mak Jehudi Serni ning antho hi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Nangni paalei mo nin e David ning angmo aleitho baksik inkhat amanompha? Ama le ami ngaining anwon acham karra, <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Thm 24:9</ref></char></note>amaning Pathien inn alut a khan Pathien denga anpe waipol kha aleibak. Hiwahi Abiathar ning Thiempu Chungnung achang laikhan aleisuok. Eini Senadan dungjui a hiwa waipol hichu thiempu beining anbak sik e tak David ning num aleibak, khan ama mi ngainum aleipe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Khan Jesu ning atorna ati, &lt;&lt;Jehudi Serni kini hichu miring ngai thanasik a anbol e; miring ngaihi Jehudi Serning kini sik a abol imak. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Khawa jarra Miring Sapa hi Jehudi Serni kini ning sik num Puma e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kut kithi mipa inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Khan Jesu ning Synagogue aleikirnok, khawa khan akut kithi miring inkhat aleiom. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Jesu ning akidikmak atho tia akitinom mi alek khawakhan anleiom; khawa jarra Jehudi Serni kini khan amaning mipa kha amindam sikmi tia akatha anlei ensui. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Jesu ning mipa deng aleiti, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Hiwa amateng hin hongkalro.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Khan amaning mi ngaideng aleirakal, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Jehudi Serni kini khan eini Senadan ning angmo tho atha ati e? Sansik mi a-imakli akathamak tho sikmi? Mi inkhat ringkho sansik a-imakli minmang sik mi?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Takkha anmanining ite leirilmuk. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Jesu ning amit alei kiwella anmanideng alei enna aleirang, tak anmani sik mulung leihoipui mak, ajarchu anmani mulung kanger le anthamak jarra aleipongpui. Khawasoli amaning mipa dengkhan aleiti, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Nu kut keisoro.&gt;&gt;</char> Amaning akut aheikeiso a, khan akutkha amasa anga aleidam. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Khawa jarra Pharisees ngaining Synagogue anmathaanna anleise khan Herod mi alek ngaile kinnot a ankinmu a, anmanining Jesu thatnasik sin anleikinthok.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuitham panga mipuingai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Jesu ning athiemroi ngaile Galilee tuitham teng anleise, khan mipui katamtak ning anuk anleijui. Anmani ngaikha Galilee, Judea ria anleihong, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Jerusalem, Idumea, Jordan nisotenga, khan Tyre le Sidon khopui asir-apang ria anhong kinphut. Hiwa mirikip ngaihi Jesu deng anleihong ajarchu amaning atho ngaikha anleijet. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mk 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lk 5:1-3</ref></char></note>Mipui antamhei jarra ama an-uum maknasik Jesu ning athiemroi ngaideng rukuong inkhat amasik rathok ru aleiti. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Amaning mi katamtak aleimindam, khan akana rikip ning ama kotok nasik anlei kin et-tarpui ama omnateng anlei nai. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Khan Ratha kathamak kulut mirikip ning ama anmu karkhan, anmani ning amaikunga anleipur khan anlei-ong, &lt;&lt;Nangchu Pathien Sapa kha ni-e!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Jesu ning ratha kathamak kulut anmani ngaideng ama atu mi tihi atu inkhat deng rilmuru tia chong kangertak aleipe.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning tirle somle-inni akadang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Khan Jesu ning chingmuol chunga akalla khan amaning amonom mi ngaikha aleikoi. Anmani ning amadeng anheiwo a, <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>khan amaning somle-inni ngaikha aleikadang, tirle tia aleipho. &lt;&lt;Kei le akaom sik a nangnihi kanakadang ejei,&gt;&gt; amaning anmanideng aleiti. &lt;&lt;Keining nangni chongkiril sik a kunumuso sik, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>Khan khori ngai holsuok nasik ranak ninnei sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Hiwa senghi amaning akadang somle-inni ngaikha an e: Simon, Jesu ning Peter tia ariming apho; <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>James le anaipa John, Zebedee ngai naite, Jesu ning Boanerges tia ariming aleipho, hiwa tinachu &lt;&lt;Rokinri Mi&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, James Alphaeus sapa, Thaddaeus, khan Canan ria Simon, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>Khan mi khutchunga akapesuok sikpa Judas Iscariot, hiwa ngaihi an e.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu le Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Khan Jesu inn teng aleise. Mipui akatamtak anhong kinchun nok a Jesu le athiemroi ngaikha bubak nasik pha leinei muk. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Ama insung mi ngaining hiwa chong anjetkarra, anmani ning amakha roisuok nasik anleitho, ajarchu mipui ning anleiti, &lt;&lt;Amahi akinwetjei!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char>
    </note>Jerusalem teng ria akahong Dan Oja alek ngaining anleiti, &lt;&lt;Ama sunga Beelzebul aom! Anmani holsuok nasik amadeng ranak akape kha khori ngai lukakeipa e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Khawa jarra Jesu ning anmani ngaikha akolla akoi-a khan anmanideng chongtekak ngaikha aleirilpe: &lt;&lt;Seitan ning kho-ongmo seitan aholsuok tor sik? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Rengram inkhat ning ankin khoithenna rupni ansuokli inkhatle inkhat ankinsol inchu, khawa rengram kha akoisik e. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Insung inkhat akin khoithenna rupni ansuokli inkhatle inkhat ankinsol inchu, khawa insung kha akoisik e. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Khawa jarra Seitan rengram hi rupni suok a ankin khoithen inchu, khawakha sotno ning, takkha koi ata ahekna amang ripsik e.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>&lt;&lt;Tu inkhat ningnum akarat mipakha ankhit masa a adamak inchu; a-inna lutli neinak rikip kha khektor nonung. Kha inchu mipa kha ankhit masa inchu neinak kha ankhektor sik.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>&lt;&lt;Akidik a keining nangnideng kiti hi e, khachu mi ngai setna le akathamak rikip anril angjet aleiom inum rangaimindam pesik e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akathamak rikip anril angjet aleiom inum; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a-imakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathien chunga akathamak akiril ngaikha</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Lk 12:10</ref></char></note> Takkha atu inum Ratha Kintheng chunga akirildek ngaikha angtikkar inum rangaimindam penoning, ajarchu amaning kumleiko setna athojei.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>&lt;&lt;Ama sunga ratha kathamak kha aom&gt;&gt; mi alek ning anti jarra, Jesu ning hiwahi aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu anu le anaingai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Khan Jesu anu le anaingai anhongtung. Anmani ning inn tolla anngirra khan ama kinmu pui sik a chong anlei muso. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Jesu akolla mipui katamtak anlei kin ong, khan anmani ning amadeng anleiti, &lt;&lt;Enro, nunu le nu-u nanai, naser ngaining tolla nang ana kinmu puinom a an om.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Atumi kei kunu? Atumi kei ku-u kanai ngai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Ama akolla akin-ong mipui ngaikha ahei enna aleiti, &lt;&lt;Enru! Hinna akaom ngaihi kei kunu le ku-u kanai ngaikha an e! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Atu-tu inum Pathien lungdo kutho ngaikha ku-u, kanai, kunu le kaser ngaikha an e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Muchi kaworpa chongtekak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lk 5:1-3</ref> </char>
    </note>Jesu ning Galilee tuitham panga minchuna aleiphut nok. Ama akolla anhong kinchun mipui ngaikha antam hei jarra amaning rukuong sunga alut a alei kin ong. Rukuong kha tuichung a aleiom, khan mipui ngaining tuipanga anleikintup. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Amaning chongtekak ngai aneiman a anmanideng chong katamtak aleiminchu, khan anmanideng aleiti:<verse eid="MRK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>&lt;&lt;Rangairu! Phakhat a mipa ning muchiru kaworsik a aleisuok. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Amaning lei a muchiru kha aheiworkar, alek ning lampui sirra ata, khan wa ngaining anhonga a anleibak. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Alek ning lungkarra leipil tomna khan aleita. Muchiru kha kinranga ahongmong, ajarchu leipil kha lei kinthuk mak. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Khan, kini ahongsuok karra, muchikek ngaikha akinwoi a aleicharjei; ajarchu anrujung kha akinthuk a alutmak jarra. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Muchiru alekning riling-bil karra aleita, anhongmong takkha riling ning aleidiip a, kara leineimuk. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Takkha muchiru alekchu leipil thana-a aleita, muchiru ngaikha anhongkek a, anhong kin-son khan kara anhongnei, alekning somthum, somruk, khan alekning reijakhat anhongkinra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Khan Jesu ning atorna aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kour ninnei inchu hiwahi rangai ru!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chongtekak ngai ajar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Lk 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Jesu kha abinga aleiom lai, achong leikajet alek ngaile athiemroi somle-inni ngai amadeng anheiwa khan Chongtekak ngaikha kinchenna rilchen nasik amadeng anleirakal. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Pathien Rengram jarra akin-iip ngaikha anape jei.&gt;&gt; Takkha tu inum tolla kaom milak ngaisik chu, chongtekak hining hiwa rikip ngaihi anjetsik, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Is 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref> (LXX)</char></note>khawa jarra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">&lt;&lt; &lt;Anmanining enchu an-en sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">takkha munonung;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">anmanining rangaichu anrangai sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">takkha jetnonung.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Kha-ang antho inchu, anmani ning Pathien deng anheikir noksik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">khan amaning anmani ngaikha arangai mindamsik.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning muchi kaworpa chongtekak aril minchen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Khan Jesu ning anmanideng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Hiwa chongtekak hi nangni ning jetlei mo nin e? Kha inchu, nangni ning alak chongtekak ngai kho-ongmo ninjet torsik? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Muchi kaworpa ning Pathien chongkha awor. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Miring alek khachu lampui-sir a akata muchi ngaikhale akin-ang; anmani ning khawa chongkha kinranga anjetli, Seitan khan aheiwali amulung sunga kaom chongkha akhekjei. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Miring alek ngaining lungkarra akata muchi khale akin-ang. Anmani ning khawa chongkha kinranga anjetli, rokpui tak a anleiralang. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Takkha anmani mulung kinthuk a leilutmak, ajarchu anmani akasot a leidei tormuk. Khawa chong jarra khan, pongna a-imakli minpongna aheiwakar khanchu, anmani ning kinremma anmoso. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Miring alek ngaikha riling bil karra akata muchi khale akin ang. Anmani ngaihi chong kajetjei ngaikha an-e, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>takkha hiwa ringkho sik a mulung pongna, neile hoi kumunom, khan alalak munomna rikip ngaikha ahonglut a, khawa chongkha anminmang, khan anmani ning kara neimuk. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Takkha miring alek khachu leithoi thana munna anwor muchi khale ankin-ang. Anmani ning chongkha anrangai, anleiralang, khan kara annei: alekning somthum, somruk, khan alekning reijakhat akara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taidon thoia thangmei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Lk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lk 11:33</ref> </char>
    </note>Jesu ning arilminjom, &lt;&lt;Tu inkhat ning thangmei aheichoi a Taidon thoia a-imakli phenchung thoi a anda ngaimi? Thangmei mutungna chunga anda-ngai ileimi? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lk 12:2</ref></char></note>Alei kinthup ngaikha alahong kinlar sik e, khan alei kinkhu rikip ngaikha ala kinlong sik e. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Kuor kanei ning hiwahi rangairu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Lk 6:38</ref></char>
    </note>Amaning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nangni ninjet ngaikhan kinsing theiru! Nangni ning mi ngai chunga chong nintan anga nangni dengnum Pathien ning atansik e, takkha akikheldet sik e. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lk 19:26</ref></char></note>Alek akanei ngaikha khella akinpe sik, khan akanei phitmak ngaikha ama anei alekkha akinkhek del sik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aheikomong muchi tekak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Jesu ning aleirilnok, &lt;&lt;Pathien Rengram khachu hi-ang e, mipa inkhat ning ama leipuk a muchiru awor khale akin-ang. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Amaning jaanna ajal, suun eli athei sik, khan khawa awor muchiru ngaikha anheikek a anheimong. Kha inum amaning kho-ongmo aheimonga aheikhang e ti leijetmak. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Leipil khaning muchikek ngaikha aminmong khan anheikara; amasatak adon anheisuok, khanchu aheiper, khan atorna a sawui katha kha akara. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joe 3:13</ref></char></note>Sang kha aminkara, mipa ning koite ning sang ka-at aleiphut, ajarchu sang-at phakha aheitungjei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ancham ru chongtekak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mat 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Lk 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Jesu ning aleirakal, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Pathien Rengram hi anglemo akin-ang niti sik? Eini ning ang chongtekak mo nineiman li niril minchen sik e?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/><char style="wj">Khawa khachu, Mipa khaning leithoichunga anchamru akisintak aru achoi a, khan leipilla awor khale akin-ang.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/><char style="wj">Apha alek so a ahongkomong anser-leina ngai karra akaloktak inkhat ahongchang. Khan abaak kolok ngai ahongsuok a khawa khan wa ngaining anrubu anleisak.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Jesu ning ama chongkha mi ngaideng aleiril, hiwa anga chongtekak katamtak ngaihi aneimanna; amaning anmani anjettor laiseng aleirilpe. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Amaning chongtekak kinchallei a anmanideng ite inkhat num leirilpe mak, takkha ama thiemroi ngaile bei an om karkhan, amaning kinchenna angrikip ngaikha anmanideng aleirilpe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning phaiwopui amindai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Khawa nitak kholeiteng khan Jesu ning athiemroi ngaideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Eini tuitham ralkhat teng kai inlang se rangri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Khawa jarra anmani ning mipui ngaikha aleimathaan; athiemroi ngaining Jesu alei chuongna rukuong khan anlut a, khan anmani ning amakha anleiroi. Rukuong aleknum khawa munkhan aleiom. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Jetlei theilei a phaiwo pui karat inkhat ahongranga, tui akinnok khan rukuong pangkha ahong jemma tuikulut aleiphut, rukuong kha tuining hongsip sik aleitho. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Jesu ning rukuong nukteng khan, montum aneia aleijal. Athiemroi ngaining ama ankeithei a anleiti, &lt;&lt;Oja, keini thisik kintijei nadonlei sikmo ni-e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Jesu ning angir a phaiwo dengkhan chong aleipe, &lt;&lt;Omchenro!&gt;&gt; khan amaning tuikinnok dengkhan aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kinnok maro!&gt;&gt; phaiwo kha rangmak jei, khan arikip ahongdaijei. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Khan Jesu ning athiemroi ngaideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Angsikmi kha-angtuk ninchi e? Tunkutung nangni taksenna ninlaneimak e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Takkha anmani ning anchi hei a inkhatle inkhat deng anlei-kinril, &lt;&lt;Hiwa mipa hi atumi? Phaiwo le tuikinnok ningnum amachong anjui hi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning Ratha kathamak kulutpa amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Jesu le ama thiemroi ngai Galilee tuitham ralkhat teng, Gerasa ramkol teng anwatung je. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Jesu rukuong ria kinrangtak a ahei suoklimli, thaan khur ria ahei kosuok pasal inkhat ning ama alei kintong pui. Hiwa mipa hi asunga ratha kathamak aleikoron a e, <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>khan thaanna alei kaom e. Tute ningnum thirrui khit a anda tormak je alei e; <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>ake le akut thirrui a anlei khitchak, tak apha rikip a thirrui kha aphoi chet a thir khaning ake alei rachak. Ama ranak aleirat rangra khana tu tening num leikhap tormuk. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Sun le jan thaan le chingmoul kutung alonna, aleikheek a khan abinga lungning aleikin-at.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Amaning akalakdet a-om lai Jesu kha aleimu; khanchu alei taanna, amai kunga kemorkhup athep a aleikinkun, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>khana aleikheek a, &lt;&lt;Jesu, Akin Sangtak Pathien Sapa! Kei angmo nulo rong niti e? Pathien jarra, kinini e, kei nimin pong moro!&gt;&gt; ati. <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Amaning hi ati ajarchu Jesu ning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Ratha kathamak, hiwa mipa ria heisuokro!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Khawa jarra Jesu ning amadeng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Niriming angmi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Mipa ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Kei kiriming, &lt;Akatam&gt; ajarchu keini kintam!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Khan khawa ram ria ratha kathamak ngaikha aholsuok mak nasik amaning Jesu deng akin ni a aleiom.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Khawa kolla khan wok katamtak rup inkhat khawa chingkolla khan bu anbak a anleiom. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Khawa jarra ratha kathamak ngai khan Jesu deng anleini, &lt;&lt;Wok ngai deng son numoso ro, asunga lutkinte,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Amaning aminse jei, ratha kathamak ngai kha mipa deng ria ansuok a wok ngai sunga anhong lut je. Wok ngaikha akin chuna lising inni kopo an e, korolkham ankin chom thak a tuitham sunga anlut rip jei.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Wok kakhal ngai kha antaan a khopui sunga le akho khoa anwaril minthang jei. Mipui ngaikha omchen akosuok aka-en sik anheiwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Khana anmani ning Jesu deng anhong karra, akatam khori koronpa kha anleimu. Ama khana khan alei kin ong, pon akinsilla akilim senga aleiom; khan anmani rikip ning anlei chi. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Khori kulutpa le wok ngai chunga kosuok omchen aleikumu ngaining mipui ngaideng anleiril pe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Khawa jarra anmani ning Jesu deng anram moso nasik a anleiti.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Jesu ning rukuong sunga alutlai, khori koronpa khaning, &lt;&lt;Nangle sebung ri!&gt;&gt; tia aleikinni.<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Takkha Jesu ning leinom pe mak. Khawa nek a amaning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nang na-inna kir-inlang na-insung mi ngaideng angtuk a Puma ning nangsik a anathope le anaminreng kha waminjet ro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Khawa jarra mipa kha Decapolis (tinachu Khopui som) kutungbit aleise, Jesu ning amasik angtuk a mo athope e ti kha awaril je. Khan akajet rikip ngaining anleingak.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jairus sanu le Jesu aponmor kotoknu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Jesu tuitham ralkhat teng rukuong a akirnok. Khawa tuitham kolla khan mipui katamtak akolla ankintup je. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Jairus, khawa kho synagogue sik a sin koronpa, ahongtunga, khan Jesu amu a akekunga abinga ahongkinbok, <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>Khan mulung kuluttak a aleikinni, &lt;&lt;Kasanu kisin ranak tak a ana je. Minreng tak a hong inlang adam nasik le aring nasik achunga nukut nawada pero!&gt;&gt; aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Khan Jesu ama le kinroi a ase a, khan mi katamtak Jesu le kinroi a mipuining amakha anuk-ama ankin et-tarpui je.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Khawa khan kum somle inni thi akosuok khodeng kathei tak numeisa inkhat aleiom, <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>mika en thiempu katamtak ning anlei en rawang leidam mak. Asumsan nei rikip aleineiman so je, tak akana adampui nek a apha rikip a akintet det je. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Khawanu ning Jesu chungchanga aleijet, khawa jarra mipui karra ahonga anukteng ahei jui, <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>abinga alei kinti, &lt;&lt;Aponmor bei inum kokotok tor inchu damna kanei sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Khawanu ning aponmor alei kotok a, athi kosuok kha khawa phatak a abang je; khana akana kha adamjei tikha abinga mulung sunga akinjet. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Khawa laitak khan Jesu ning ama ria aranak akosuok kha aleijet je, khawa jarra amaning mipui ngaideng ahei kinhei a a-enna aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Atu ningmo kopon akotok e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Ama thiemroi ngaining anheimasanga, &lt;&lt;Mipui hiseng hining ana-umtur numu; angsik a mo nangdeng anukotok kha nana rakal e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Takkha Jesu ning khawa akotok mikha amu nasik asir-apang alei en. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Numeinu achunga omchen kosuok kha akin jet a, achi pumma ahonga, ake kunga akinkunna, akidik rikip kha amadeng awaril je. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Jesu ning khawanu deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kasanu, nataksenna khaning animindam eje. Akahoi-akadai a setro, napongna ria dam rang ro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Jesu ning hi arillai, Jairus inn ria chongkoron mi alek anhonga amadeng anlei ti, &lt;&lt;Nasanu kha athijei, Oja kha angsik mo niminpong sik e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Angmi anmanining anleitikha Jesu ning leirangai pemak,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ite leirangai pemak</char></note> takkha lamkakeipa deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Chimaro, taksen bei taksen ro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Khan amaning Peter, Jame khan anaipa John ilei a tute anuk leimin juimak. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Anmani ning Jairus inn anheitung je, khanna khan mingai kinhangna le chap ong rasa rikip Jesu ning aleijet. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Insung alut a anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Angsik mo ankin hang e? Angsik mo ninchap e? Naipangnu hi akithi imak, akajal e!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Anmani ning anlei munuipui, khawa jarra amaning anmani rikip tolla aleiminsuok, naipangnu anu le apa khan athiemroi inthum ngai aroi a naipangnu jalna den sunga anlut je. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Amaning naipangnu akut ama-o a aleiti, &lt;&lt;Talitha, Koum,&gt;&gt; hiwa tina chu, &lt;&lt;Naipangnu, keining thei ro kiti!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Khawa laitak khan naipangnu kha akinding a aleilon jel. Naipangnu kha kum somle-inni a ije. Khawa omchen asuoklai khan, anmani ning anleingak. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Takkha Jesu ning atukhat dengnum rilmaknasik tia anmanideng chong kharna aleinei, khan Jesu ning aleiti &lt;&lt;Naipangnu kha baksik angmikhat peru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesu kha Nazareth a leidonmuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Jesu ning khawa munkha amathaanli ama khopui teng aleikir je, ama thiemroi ngai num anlei jui. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Jehudi Serni kinining synagogue a minchuna aleiphut jei. Mikatam tak khana khan anlei om, achong kha anjet a anmani rikip ning kinlak ansak rip je. &lt;&lt;Hiwa ngaihi khonarimo apha e? Ang singna mi amadeng akin pehi? Kho-ong mi sinkinlak ngai athotor hi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Amahi thingsin kothopa, Mary sapa, James, Joseph, Judas, khan Simon ngai ulenai kha elei mi? Anainu ngai hin an-om elei mi?&gt;&gt; khanchu anmani ning ama leidon muk je.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Pathien chongkachoi ngaihi, akhosung le a-insung, khan ulenai elei a, mun rikip achu kajana annei e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Khawa munnakhan amaning akadam mak alek chunga akut ada a amindam elei a, sinkinlak ite leitho tormak. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Mipui ning taksenna anleineimak jarra, Jesu ning aleingak.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesu ning thiemroi somle inni amuso</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Khawasoli Jesu ning ase a asir apanga kaom kho ngaideng aleiminchu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Amaning thiemroi somle-inni ngai kha akoitup a khan mi ini-ini-a aleimoso. Ratha kathamak ngai chunga thotorna ratha aleipe, <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lk 10:4-11</ref></char></note>khan chong aleipe, &lt;&lt;Ninlam nin se na khengrol elei a neinak inkhat te ron dal muru, waipol, paitu, sumsankok a sumsan, choi muru. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Keto chuongru, tak songkol akikhel choi muru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Amaning anmanideng arilnok a, &lt;&lt;Mingai ning analeidonna mun nakhan, amun kha nada mak laiseng khawa inna khan omru. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Sin 13:51</ref></char></note>Khopui inkhat a nahong lut karkhan mi ngai ning analeidon mak a-imakli nachong an rangaimak inchu, khawa mun kha leidaru khanna ninkepha ruhut leikithing thak ru. Khawa kha anmani sik mulungkoina achang sik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Khawa soli anmani ning anleisuok a mingai kha ansetna ria mulung thulnasik chong anleiril. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Jam 5:14</ref></char></note>Anmani ning khori katamtak holsuokna anleinei, khan akana mi katamtak ngai chunga Olive sarek akonot a anmindam jei.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lk 9:19</ref></char>
    </note>Tunchu Reng Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Reng Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipas, Galilee waikaronpa.</char></note> ning angrikip chungchanga ajet je, ajarchu Jesu riming athana kha mun rikip a alei kinthang je. Mi alek ning anleiti, &lt;&lt;John Baptist thina ria ahong ringnok je! Khawa jarra hi-ang sinkinlak thonasik ranak hi anei e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Achang rawang alek ning anleiti, &lt;&lt;Amahi Elijah e.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Alek ning anleiti, &lt;&lt;Amahi atenlai aleikaom Pathien chongkachoi anga Pathien chongkachoi inkhat ang e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Herod ning hiwo ajet a, amaning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Amahi John Baptist e! Keining alu kalei tan e je, tak ahong ringnok je!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19">Lk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note>Herod atakning John surna sik chong aleimoso, khan thir rui ning aleikhit a khan mikhumna sunga aleida. Herod ning hi-ang aleitho hi anaipa Philip numei amaning alei kusut a alei ompui hi, Herodias jarra e. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>John Baptist ning Herod deng hi-ang aril pe chak, &lt;&lt;Nanaipa numei na-ompui sik hi nangsik akidik imak!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Khawa jarra Herodias ning John kha lei-en nommak khana that sik a aleimindon, tak Herod a-om jarra leitho tormak. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Herod ning John kha aleichi ajarchu John kha mi katha le akintheng e ti aleijet. Herod ning John chongril arangai phakhan mulung aleipong inum ama chongril kha aleirangainom, khawa jarra amakha akathatak a aleida.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Atorna Herodias ning apha kathatak aleimu je. Khawakha Herod aneining nikho e, khawa ning amaning ram waikaron akolok rikip, raal lamkakei, khan Galilee ram kakei ngai bak minchunna athopui na pha kha e. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Herodias <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herodias sanu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscripts alek achu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ama sanu Herodias. </char></note> sanu aheilut a ahong laam, khan Herod le khomol ngaiseng kha anmulung aleimintai. Khawa jarra rengpa ning numeisanu deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Angmi nangning nomonom? Kei ning nang nomonom rikip kanape sik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Khan amaning kintepna katamtak le akinhakserra aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nangning ninini rikip kei ning kanapesik, karengram aherkhat inum!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Khawa jarra numeisanu ning asuok a anudeng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Angmi keining kini sik?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Anuning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;John Baptist lu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Numeisanu kha kinnot a aheikirra rengpa deng ahongni, &lt;&lt;Kei ning hiwa mun takhin khan atunhin John Baptist lu kha kheeng chunga nanape sik komonom!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Hiwa hin Rengpa amulung apong je, tak ama khomol ngai maikunga alei kintep jarra khan numeisanu nina kha nang leititor mak je. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Khan rengpa ning akangaak raalmi inkhat khawa laitak khan John lu heichoi sik a chong aleipe a aleitir je. Akangaak pa kha mikhumna a ahong se-a, khan John lu kha ahong tenjei; <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Khan kheeng inkhat chunga alu kha aheichoi minlut a numeisanu deng aleipe, amanu ning khawakha anudeng aleipe jei. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>John thiemroi ngaining khawa chongkha anjetli, anmani anhonga khan akulong kha anlei-a khan thaan na anwaphum jei.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning mipui katamtak awai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Tirle ngai kha anhong kirra khan Jesu le anlei kinmu, khan ansintho rikip le mi anlei minchu ngaikha amadeng anlei ril. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Khawakhan mi akase le akahong mikatam tak anlei-om jarra Jesu le athiemroi ngai bu baksik apha num leimutor muk. Khawa jarra Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Eini nibinga ni-om thei nasik munna se inlang pong hongminchum rangri,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Khawa jarra mun daina inkhat a anmani bei rukuong anchuong a anleise je.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Achang rawang anmani anse kha mi katamtak ning anmu a khan anmani an e tikha anleijet; khawa jarra khopui rikip a mi anhong suok a khan antaan a Jesu le athiemroi ngai makma amun kha anleitung masa jei. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Tel 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Ren 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Kha 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Eze 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref></char></note>Jesu ning rukuong ria aheisuok pha, mipui katamtak ngaikha aleimu, khan anmani sik a amulung kha minrengna asip je, ajarchu anmani ngaikha keelmong kakhal kinchal lei keelmong anlei ang je. Khawa jarra amaning chong katamtak aminchu aphut je. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Khan kholei aheitung phakhan, athiemroi ngai anhonga amadeng anleiti, &lt;&lt;Tunchu apha hi ommak je, khan amun hi mi daina mun e. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Mipui ngai hi minse inlang, anmani ning anaina khosung a-imakli ruhonna se inlang anbak nasik kinrocho rusu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Nangni ning anmanideng angmikhat baknasik peru.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Anmani ning anleirakal, &lt;&lt;Keinining kinseli sumsan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sumsan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hiwo sumsan hichu nikho inkhatta ratha man e (Mat 20:2 anri)</char></note> reini ning waipol kinrachopeli anmani kinminbak sik hi nangning numunom mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Khawa jarra Jesu ning anmanideng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Waipol angjet mo ninnei e? Se inlang hong en ru.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Anmani ning anhong entok a, &lt;&lt;Waipol ranga khanchu nga inni,&gt;&gt; tia anlei minjet.<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Khan Jesu ning athiemroi ngaideng mipui ngai kha arup-rup a khoithen nasik le aka-em sachik chunga min-ong nasik aleiminjet. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Khawa jarra mipui ngaikha reikhat rup khan somranga rup mintaang a ankin-ong je. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Khan Jesu ning waipol ranga le nga inni kha alei a, marwan teng a-inna, khan Pathien aminpak. Waipol kha aher akhoi a khan mingai deng semnasik athiemroi ngaideng ape je. Amaning nga inni khanum anmani rikip deng asem pe je. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Mi rikip ning anbak a khan anlei khoprip. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Khawa soa athiemroi ngaining mingai bak akinlek waipol le nga kha taidon somle inni akisip mer an rut. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Khawaning Awai minkhop pasal seng ngaikha lising ranga an e.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu tui chunga alon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Amaning mipui ngai minse sik atilai, kinranga Jesu ning athiemroi ngaikha rukuong a aminlut a tuitham ralkhat, Bethsaida khopui ama modondet a aleiminse. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Jesu ning mingai akinthen pui soli, amaning chingmuolla Pathien nina aleise. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Kholeiteng ahong tunga, Jesu tuitham panga abinga alei omlai khan rukuong khachu tuitham lai a aleiom. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Amaning athiemroi ngai pongna kha aleimu, ajarchu phaiwo karang karat kha anlei kintongpui; kha-ang khan jingteng pung inthum le pung kuruk karra Jesu ning tui chunga anmanideng aheiwa a amaning anmanikha aheikhel deng karkhan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">anmanikha aheikhel karkhan; anmani le kinchuna.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Amaning tui chunga ahonglon kha anmukar khan, &lt;&lt;Hiwa hichu raikho e!&gt;&gt; antia anleikheek. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Anmani ning anleimu karkhan anmani rikip anleikinlai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Khawa laitak khan Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kin-ngam na nei ru! Chimuru, Kei ki e!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Khan amaning anmani rukuong sunga aleilut, khan phaiwo kha aleibang jei. Khan athiemroi ngaining anleingak rangra, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>ajarchu anmani ning mipui lising ranga awaikha ajar leijet muk; anmulung ning khawa kha leisur tormuk.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning Gennesaret a mikana amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Anmani ning tuitham anleirakaan a Gennesaret ramteng anheiwa, khanna khan rukuong kha tuitham panga anleikhit. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Anmani ning rukuong anleida solimli, mi ngaining Jesu kha anleijet kalen. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Khan khawa ram mipui ngaining anleijet karkhan khawa munteng anheitaanna anheiwa; khan khonna a-e inum ama aom ti anjet inchu, akana ngai amadeng anheiroi a apher chunga anleiminjal. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Jesu sena mun rikip, kho, khopui, ruhon kutung achanga, mingai ning akana ngaikha keithel munna anheiroi a apon morbei inum mintok nasik anleini. Khan khawa pon mor aleikotok rikip ngaikha anleidam.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Pirui Purui minchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Jerusalem ria akahong Pharisees le Dan Oja alek Jesu kolla anhong kintup. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Ama thiemroi alek ning ankut soplei a bu anleibak kha anmani ning anleimu, hiwahi anmani senadan dungjui a akinthengmak e, tichu anmani ning ankut kha Pharisees ngaining mipuideng anminchu anga leithomuk.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>(Ajarchu Pharisees le Jehudi rikip ning pi le pu ngai leiminchu senadan anleijui: ankut kha akatha ansopmak laiseng anmani ning leibak muk; <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>khanchu keithel ria anheichoi neinak ngaikha amasa ansop mintheng mak laiseng leibak muk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ang-rikip akinjor nari anheichoi neinak kha amasatak ansop; ang-rikip akinjor nari anhong inum anmani amasatak akinsop.</char></note> Khale kinroi a anmani ning alak senadan akatam anleijui, tichu hai, bel, sumbel khan phenchung ngaihi anlei sop mintheng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akinje alek a chu phenchung om-mak.</char></note>)<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Khawa jarra Pharisees ngai le Dan Oja ngai ning Jesu deng anleirakal, &lt;&lt;Angsik jarrami nang thiemroi ngai ning eini pi le pu khanga anleida minchuna anleijui mak, takkha khawa nek a kut achok pumma anleibak?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6-7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Is 29:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesu ning anmanideng aleimasang, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Isaiah chongsaan kha kho-ongtuk akidikmi nangni jarra! Nangni akatha kinlem nin e, tia hi-anghin aleimije:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">&lt;Hiwa mingai hining anmur bei ning anakaja, Pathien ning ati,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">Tak anmulung chu kei ria akalaak a an-om.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Kei anukumuk hinum anmani sik anemna ommak,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">Ajarchu anmani ning miring senadan anminchu kha</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">Pathien Dan anga anmani ning anminchu!&gt;</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Nangni ning Pathien chongpe kha ninda-a khan miring ngai minchuna kha ninjui.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Khan Jesu ning atinok, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ninbing a minchuna kha minsethei nasik ninsing theina khaning Pathien Dan kha kinlep nasik lampui nin-neije.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Hon 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Thm 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Dan 5:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ajarchu Moses chongpe nakhan, &lt;Napa le nanu nakaja sik,&gt; khan, &lt;Napa le nanu akathamak a nirilset inchu, nangkha thina apesik e.&gt;</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/><char style="wj">Takkha nang minchunna khachu mi inkhat ning ang-mikhat apa a-imakli anu santheina anei inum, tak nang ning niti, &lt;Hiwa hi Corban&gt; tinachu, Pathien ta e,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/><char style="wj">Amaning anpa a-imakli annu sansik ria minsan mukchujei.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/><char style="wj">Hi-ang hin minchuna kha milak ngaideng ninmintunga Pathien chongkha ninten jei. Khana hi-ang kupo neinak alalak akatam nangni ning nintho.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miring akimintheng mak neinak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Khan Jesu ning mipui ngaikha ama kolla akoinok a khan anmanideng aleiti, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Nangni rikip kachongril hi rangairu, khan jet ru.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/><char style="wj">Tol ria miring sunga alut khaning mi minchokmak. Miring sunga ria ahongkusuok khaning mi aminchok.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akinje alek achu alam 16 anhap: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Rangai ru, khanchu, ninkuor a-om inchu! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Anri 4:23)</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Amaning mipui ngaikha aleimathaanli khan inn inkhat a aleilut, ama thiemroi ngaining achongril kha minchen nasik anleirakal. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleiril, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Nangni milak ngainek a jetna neidet muk chu. Jetlei mo nin e? Tol ria miring sunga alut khaning amakha amintheng edet mak,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/><char style="wj">ajarchu khawa kha amulung sunga lutmak tak awon sunga akulut e, khawa so-a ataksa ria tolla ahongsuok e.&gt;&gt; (Jesu ning hiwa aril nahi, baksik rikip akintheng tia amalar.)</char><verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Khana amaning arilnok a, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Miring ria aheikusuok khan amakha aminchok e.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/><char style="wj">Ajarchu mi mulung sung ria, akathamak mindonna kha aheisuok a khawa khaning amakha akathamak amintho, hurna, muruk, mithatna, </char> <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/><char style="wj">mi numei-arother setpuina, phamrai kase, khan akathamak rikip akatho; wartheng kiril, ra-ot, omchen kathamak, mikirilset, kin-or, khan akapang,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/><char style="wj">Hiwa akathamak rikip ngai hi miring mulung sung ria aheisuok e khana khawa khaning ama amintheng mak e.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nupui inkhat taksenna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Khan Jesu ning khawa mun kha amathaanli Tyre khopui kolla a ase jei. Amaning inn inkhat sunga aleilut khan khawa mun na a-om kha tute ning anjet sik leimonom mak, tak akinthup a akasot leiom tor mak je. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Asanu sunga ratha kathamak kulut nupuinu khaning Jesu chungchanga ajetli kinranga ahonga akekunga aleikinbok. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Khawa nupuinu kha Syria ram a Phoenicia ramsung a akinte Jat-lop mi inkhat e. Khawanu khaning asanu ria khori kha Jesu ning aholsut penasik aleiti. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Takkha Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Amasatak a naipang ngai wai minkhop di ri. Naipang ngai bu kha kusut a ui deng pesik chu akidik imak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Khawanu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Oja, ui ngainum naipang ngai bakbang dokhang thoi-a akata ngai kha anbak e!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Khawa jarra Jesu ning khawanu deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kha ang nana heimasang jarra, ni inteng kir toro, nasanu ria khori asuok kha nawamu sik jei!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Khawanu kha inteng akirra asanu phenchunga ajal kha awamu; khori kha asanu ria adiktabak aleisuok jei.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning akachong theimak le akuornum kiset inkhat amindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Khan Jesu ning Tyre ramsung kha aleimathaan a Sidon arakaan a, Decapolis (tinachu Khopui som) ramsunga aleise a khan Galilee tuitham teng aheiwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Miring alek ning akuor kiset, khan akatha akachong theimak mi inkhat anheiroi a, Jesu ning achunga akut adape nasik anlei ni. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Khawa jarra Jesu ning amakha mipui ngai ria abinga akoisuok a, akutchalla amichil thonna akuor sunga aleithun li, khan amalei kha aleikotok pe. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Khawa soa Jesu ning marwan chungteng a-enna, kinthuktak aphuk asanna, pasalpa denga aleiti, <char style="tl">&lt;&lt;Ephphatha,&gt;&gt;</char> tinachu &lt;&lt;Kinlong taro!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Khawa pha takkhan pasalpa akuor ajet je, amalei asur kha omleia chong arilsuok torjei. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Khan Jesu ning atu inkhat deng anril mak nasik mipuideng chong ape jei; tak amaning chong ape kha akikhella rilmuru atikha akakhella anlei ril jei. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Khana akajet rikip ning anleingak jei. &lt;&lt;Ang rikip hi kho-ongtuk a akatha atho mije!&gt;&gt; anti. &lt;&lt;Kuor kiset naknum aminjet, khan akachong theimak aminchong thei!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning miring lising-minli awai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Sot lei-a mipui alop katamtak anhei kintup. Anmani ning baksik ite anleineimak lai, Jesu ning athiemroi ngaikha akoichunna aleiti, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>&lt;&lt;Hiwa mingai sik a kei kumulung apong, ajarchu anmani ngaihi kei le nithum kinhong ombung jarra, atunchu baksik ite neimuk jei. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Keining anmani bu minbak lei-a inteng kitir inchu, ansena lampui a ankinwai sik, ajarchu anmani alekchu ram kalaak ria anhong e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Ama thiemroi ngaining amadeng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Mi hiwajet wonminkhop nasik bu hi nerdiram hin atuning mo amutor sik e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Jesu ning aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Waipol angjet mo ninnei?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">&lt;&lt;Waipol sari,&gt;&gt; tia anmanining anleimasang.<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Amaning mipui ngaikha leithoi-a kin-ongnasik chong aleipe. Khan amaning waipol sari kha alei a, Pathien minpakna anei, aherkhat akhoi a mipui ngaideng semnasik ama thiemroi ngai apejei; khan ama thiemroi ngaining kha-angkhan semna annei. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Anmani ning nga akisin aleknum anlei nei. Jesu ning hiwa sik num Pathien minpak na anei-a khan khawa nga khanum thiemroi ngaideng mipui semnasik aleiti. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8-9"/>Mi rikip ning akakhop a anleibak, mi lising-minli kopo an e. Khan thiemroi ngaining anbak bang akinlek awer-awai taidon sari kisip anlei rut. Jesu ning mipui ngaikha aleiminse jei. <verse eid="MRK 8:8-9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Khan kinrang a thiemroi ngai le rukuong anchong a Dalmanutha ramteng anleise.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisee ngaining sinkinlak malarnasik anni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Lk 11:16</ref></char>
    </note>Pharisee alek ning Jesu deng anheiwa a amale anleikinkher. Anmani ning anchang kam a min-ok sik anleimonom, khawa jarra Pathien ning minthana nanei tikha sinkinlak a naminmuro tia anleini. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Lk 11:29</ref></char></note>Takkha Jesu ning kinthuktak aphuk akasaanna aleiti, &lt;&lt;Ang jarra mi tunlai khang mingai ning sinkinlak sik anarakal? Kei ning nangnideng kidik a kiniti, kha imak! Hiwa mingaideng khawa angkopo mu minchenna kha kinpe noning!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Amaning anmani ngaikha aleimathaanli, rukuong achuong nok a, khan tuitham ralkhat teng rakaan nasik anleitho jei.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisees Le Herod ngai chol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Thiemroi ngaining ankhop nasik waipol heichoi sik kha anlei mingil je, rukuong sunga anmani waipol inkhat bei anleinei. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Lk 12:1</ref></char></note> &lt;&lt;Kinsingthei ru,&gt;&gt; Jesu ning anmanideng aleitipe, &lt;&lt;khan nangni ning Pharisees ngaile Herod Chol chunga kinsingthei inlang kinrin ru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Anmani seng kinbekna anleinei a anleiti, &lt;&lt;Eini ning waipol ninei mak jarra amaning hiwahi ati e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Jesu ning anmani ngai ankinbek kha aleijet, khawa jarra amaning anmanideng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Waipol a-om mak jarra nangni ning angsik mo ninkinbek e? Tun kutung lumu lajetlei mo nin e? Ninmulung kho-ongtuk mo alanger e? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Jer 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Eze 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mk 4:12</ref></char></note>Nangni mit ninnei, mu lei mo nin e? Kuor ninnei, rangailei mo nin e? Nangni ngaidon lei mo nin e <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>mi lising-ranga sik keining waipol ranga kakhoi kha? Akinlek awer-awai taidon kho-ongjet mo ninrut?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Anmani ning anleimasang, &lt;&lt;Somle-inni,&gt;&gt; anti.<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>&lt;&lt;Khan keining mi lising-minli sik waipol sari kakhoi karra khan, akinlek awer-awai taidon kho-ongjet mo akisip ninrut?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">&lt;&lt;Sari,&gt;&gt; tia anmani ning anleimasang.<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>&lt;&lt;Khan tun kutung nangni ning lajet lei mo nin e?&gt;&gt; tia Jesu ning aleirakal.<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning Bethsaida a mitkacho pasal inkhat amindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Anmani ning Bethsaida teng anheiwa phakhan, mi alekning Jesu deng amitkacho mi inkhat an heiroi-a amadeng nakatok pero tia anleini. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Jesu ning mitkachopa kha akut ning akeiroi a khosung ri aleisuokpui. Amit kha amichil thon pe soa, Jesu ning ama chunga akut ada a aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Angmikhat numu mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Mipa khaning chungteng ahei enna aleiti, &lt;&lt;O, Keining mi ngai kumutor jei, tak anmani kha thingkung kulon anga anpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Jesu ning mipa mit a khan akut aleida nok a. Khawapha khanchu mipa kha amit aminsai kang a alei en, ama mit aleimunok a, angrikip akinthenga alei mutor jei. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Jesu ning khawa soa mipa deng ati, &lt;&lt;Hiwa khosung hin kirnok rang maro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter ning Jesu chungchang arilsuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Khan Jesu le ama thiemroi ngai Caesarea Philippi anti kho modonna anleise. Lampui ansena amaning anmanideng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Nitiru Keideng, mi ngaining Keihi atumo ki-e aniti?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Lk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char>
    </note> Anmani ning anleimasang; &lt;&lt;Mi alek ning nanghi John Baptist aniti, alek ning Elijah ni-e aniti, alek ning Pathien chongkachoi ngai karra inkhat ni-e aniti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>
    </note> Amaning anmanideng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Nangni ningle kei hi atumo ki-e ninti e?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Peter ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Nang Messiah ni-e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Khan Jesu ning anmanideng chong ape, &lt;&lt;Kei chungchang a atudeng num rilmuru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning apongnasik le athinasik aril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Khan Jesu ning athiemroi ngaideng minchuna aphut: <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Miring Sapa kha akapong tak a a-om sik e khan Upa ngaining, thiempu chungnung, khan Dan Oja ngai ningnum nom nonung. Khana amakha anthat sik, tak nithum soli ama aring nok sik e.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Amaning hiwa hi kintheng tak a anmanideng aleirilpe. Khawa jarra Peter ning ama munlopteng aroi-a alei ren minphut je. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Tak Jesu ning akinhei a, ama thiemroi ngaikha alei en, khan Peter kha alei ren khan aleiti. &lt;&lt;Komodon ria suokro, Seitan, Nang mindon kha Pathien ria imak tak miring senadan e!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14:27</ref></char>
    </note>Khan Jesu ning mipui le ama thiemroi ngai kha amadonna akoi. Amaning anmanideng aleirilpe, &lt;&lt;Atu-tu inum mi inkhat ning kunuk jui kate ati inchu, ama abinga akindon mak sik e, a cross akadomma, khan kei anajui sik e. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Ajarchu atu-tu inum abinga ringkho akinhuk nom ning akinmang sik; tak atu-tu inum kei sik le chong kintheng sik a aringkho akapesuok kha akinhuk sik e. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Simleichung pumpui ata amin e inum, tak aringkho akinmang inchu amasik a anemna angmo a-om? Anemna om mak! <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Mi inkhat ning aringkho kha angle mo akinthul thei aom mi. <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Mi inkhat ning keijarra, kei minchunna jarra, em le hur apha akathamak sunga hin kei minchuna chungchang a akinjak inchu, Miring Sapa le Apa lurna sunga marwan tirle kintheng ngaile anhongning khan amaning num amachunga ankinjak sik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Khan Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Keining akidiktak nirilpe kate, Pathien Rengram kha ranak le kinroi a akahong anmani ning anmumak laiseng khawakhan alek akithimaksik an-om.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maiso akinthul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note>Niruk soa Jesu ning Peter, James khan John, anmani ngaikha ching kinsang chung a aleiroi, khawa munna anmani bei anleiom. Anmani maikunga Jesu maiso kha aleikinthul, <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>khan ama ponder ngaikha ahongcheklak, simleichunga atu inkhatning asop minchektor maksik nek a aleichek. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Khan athiemroi inthum ngaining Moses le Elijah ning Jesu le ankinbek kha anleimu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Peter aheichong a Jesu deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Oja, angtuk akathami keini ning hiwahin kin-omhi! Keini ning hiwa munhin pon-inn inthum kinbol sik, nang sik inkhat, Moses sik inkhat, khan Elijah sik inkhat.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Ama le alak ngaikhan anchihei a amaning angmo atisik e leijet mak.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref></char>
    </note>Khan Sumphai inkhat ahongsuok a adaililip ning aleimukhu, khan Sumphai ria rasa inkhat ahonga, &lt;&lt;Hiwahi kasapa mirit tak e, ama achong rangai ru!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Anmani ning kinrangtak ankol a anlei en tak atute leimu muk; Jesu bei kha ankarra aleiom.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Anmani Ching ria anhei chum lai, Jesu ning anmanideng chong aleipe, &lt;&lt;Miring Sapa kha thina ria aring mak laiseng, ninmu ngaikha atu dengnum rilsuok muru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Anmani ning chongpe ngaikha anjui, tak anmani karra bei chongkha kinbekna anleinei, &lt;&lt;Thina ria ringna, atihi angmo atina e?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11:14</ref></char></note>Khana anmani ning Jesu deng anleirakal, &lt;&lt;Moses Dan Oja ngaining Elijah masatak ahong sik anti hi angsik jarra mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Amaning aleimasang khachu, &lt;&lt;Elijah kha e angrikip kimintuk akahong masa sik e. Kha inchu angsik jarra mi Pathien chong kintheng ning Miring Sapa kha apong angjet adeisik, khan mi ngaining nompenonung atihi angsik jarra mi? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Takkha Kei ning nangni deng kiniti, Elijah chu aleihong sojei, khan chong kintheng ning ama jarra aleiti anga, mi ngaining ama chunga anthonom kha aleithoso jei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning Ratha kathamak kulut pasalnai inkhat amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Mat 17:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Lk 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Anmani ning thiemroi alak ngai deng anhong kar, mipui katamtak ngaining akihilla, Moses Dan Oja alek le anmanile ankinkher pui kha anleimu. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Mipui ngaining Jesu anleimu pha, anmani ning anleingak, khan amadeng kinranga anse a anleidon. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Jesu ning ama thiemroi ngaideng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Ang jarra mi anmani le ninkin kherpui?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Mipui ngai karra pasal inkhat ning aheimasang, &lt;&lt;Oja, keining kasapa nangdeng kaheiroi, ajarchu ratha kathamak asunga a-om khan achongnum suokmak. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Ratha khaning ama asur katai a, leithoi a apur, abai a achilphon asuok, aha aleikarot, khan atak kha aleichangkhang: Khawa jarra keining nang thiemroi ngaideng ratha kha noholsuok penasik kaleiti, takkha anmani ning leiholsuok tor muk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Angtuk a taksenna kaneimak nangni ngai! Angtuk kosot kei ning nangni le kalaom bung sik mi? Angtuk kosot kei ning nangni kha kanaladei pui sik mi? Naipangpa kha keideng heiroi ru!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Anmani ning amakha Jesu deng anheiroi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Ratha khaning Jesu aheimuli, naipangpa kha akeichanga ahong dengjuon, khan leithoi a ata a aleikinloi khan abai a achilphon aleisuok. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>&lt;&lt;Angtuk kusot mijei hin atinahi?&gt;&gt; Jesu ning apa deng aleirakal.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">&lt;&lt;Naipang achang lai ria e tia,&gt;&gt; amaning aleimasang. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>&lt;&lt;Apha angjet akathamak ratha ning amahi thatnasik a meisunga le tui sunga adenglut e jei. Nang ning nanatho petor inchu, niminreng inlang khan nasen ro!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Jesu ning amadeng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Angsik mo niti e, nator inchu? Taksenna kanei amasik chu angrikip a ithei e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Apa ning kinranga ahei ong a, &lt;&lt;Kei taksenna kanei, tak pui tukmang. Akatam det kanei thei nasik nasen ro!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Jesu ning mipui kha anmani omnateng anheinai amukar khan, amaning ratha kathamak deng khan chong aleipe. &lt;&lt;Kuorset le chong akasuokmak ratha,&gt;&gt; Jesu ning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Naipangpa ria nang hei suok inlang khan amadeng lutkhir nok moro tia kei ning chong kanape!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Ratha khan akheek a, naipangpa kha mel kasetak akeichang er a ahong dengjuon na khan asuok jei. Naipangpa kha akithi anga, khan mirikip ning anleiti, &lt;&lt;Amahi athijei!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Takkha Jesu ning naipangpa kha akut ama-o a aleikeiding, khan ama ahongngir jei.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Khawa soa Jesu ning insung alut kar, ama thiemroi ngaining ruk a anleirakal, &lt;&lt;Angsik jarra mi keini ning ratha kha kinholsuok tor mak?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Hiwa ngaihi Pathien nina bei ning aholsuok tor e, alak inkhatte ning tor mak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning athina sik chong aril nok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Mat 17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Lk 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Jesu le ama thiemroi ngai ning khawa munkha anleimathaanna Galilee anrakaan a anleise. Jesu ning atudeng num ama sena leiminjet nommak, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>ajarchu ama thiemroi ngaikha aleiminchu: &lt;&lt;Miring Sapa kha mikathat ngai kutchunga akinpe sik. Nithum soli ama ahongring nok sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Tak anmani ning hiwa minchu nahi leijet tor muk, khan anmani ning amadeng akarakal sik anleichi.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atumi akoloktak?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Anmani ning Capernaum a anheiwa a, khan insung anlut kar Jesu ning ama thiemroi ngaideng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Nangni ning lampui ton-na ang jarrami nin kinkher?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Takkha anmani ning leimasangmuk, ajarchu lampui a anhei kinkher na khachu anmani karra atumi akolok tak ti jarra e. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat 20:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">Mk 10:43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lk 22:26</ref></char></note>Jesu ning akin-onga, athiemroi somle inni ngaikha aleikoi, khan anmanideng aleitipe, &lt;&lt;Atu achang inum amasa kachangnom khaning atorna le mi rikip sok abinga achang ngersik e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Khan amaning naipang inkhat aheiroi a khan anmani maikunga aleiminngir. Amaning akoko-a anmanideng aleiti, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char></note>&lt;&lt;Tu achang inum kei riminga hiwa naipang inkhat akaralang kha, kei anaralang e; khan tu inum kei anaralang mi khaning kei bei anaralang ilei a kei anahong kitirpa khanum aralang e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atu inum eini anikinhal puimak mikha eini mi e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49">Lk 9:49</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:50">50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>John ning amadeng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Oja, mi inkhat ning khori ngai niriminga aholsuok keini ning kinmu, khan keini ning amakha kinleikhap, ajarchu amakha eini rup karra akinchal imak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Amakha khap nasik thomuru,&gt;&gt; ajarchu kei riminga sinkinlak kotho je mi ning khawa nukteng kinrangtak mi kha eini mi akathamak a nirilset noning. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Lk 11:23</ref></char></note>Ajarchu atu inum eini anikinhal puimak mi kha an e. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mat 10:42</ref></char></note>Keining akidiktak a kiniril pe e, nangni keita ninchang jarra, tuidai hai inkhat bei anakape tu inum athoman kha aphang nger sik e.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Setna thonasik mithemna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Lk 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>&lt;&lt;Atu inum hiwa naipang kisin inkhat taksenna minmang nasik akatho mikha atu achang inum aringa chakri lung kolok inkhat khit makhai pe-a tui-ongpui sung matasik khawa khaning ama sik athadet. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat 5:30</ref></char></note>Khawa jarra nukut khaning nataksenna aminmang inchu, tanro! Nukut akikip a akithiphit maksik meikhur nulutsik nek chu kut kinchel lei-a kumsot ringna naphasik khaning athadet.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akinje alek a alam 44 anhap: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">&lt;Khana anmani kabak rulung kha thiphit mak, khan anmani anrona akakang mei khanum thiphit mak&gt; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(alam 48 a anri)</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Khan nike khaning nataksenna aminmang sik inchu, tuktan ro! Nike akikip a meikhur a nulutsik nek a nike kinchel lei-a kumsot ringna naphang sik khaning athadet.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akinje alek a alam 46: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">&lt;Khana anmani kabak rulung kha thiphit mak, khan anmani anrona akakang mei khanum thiphit mak&gt; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(alam 48 a anri)</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat 5:29</ref></char></note>Khana nimit khaning nataksenna aminmang sik inchu, kelsuok ro! Mit akikip a meikhur a nulutsik nek chu mit inkhat bei le Pathien Rengram nulutsik khaning athadet. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Is 66:24</ref></char></note>Khawakhan &lt;anmani kabak rulung ngaikha thiphit muk, khan anmani anrona mei akakang khanum thiphit mak.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>&lt;&lt;Maicham neinak kha michi ning amintheng anga mi rikip num mei ning amintheng sik e.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Lk 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char>
    </note>&lt;&lt;Michi hi akatha e; Tak a-elna kha asep jei inchu, kho-ongmo ninmin el theinok sik e?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">&lt;&lt;Nangni sap ninchangna michi kha ninbinga kara nei ru, khan inkhat le inkhat kahoi kadai om ru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning kinthen chungchanga aminchu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Khan Jesu ning amun kha aleimathaanli, Judea ramteng ase je, khan Jordan Tuidung arakaan je. Mipui ngai amadeng anhong kinchun nok je, amaning anga-ngai atho anga anmanideng aleiminchu.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Pharisees alek amadeng anhonga khan anchangkhit a min ok nasik anlei tho. Amadeng anleirakal, &lt;&lt;Mi inkhat ning anumei akinthen pui sik hi eini Dan ning anom mi, niminjet ro?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Jesu ning chong rakal le kinroi a aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Moses ning nangni kho-ong Dan mo anape?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Dan 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5:31</ref></char>
    </note> Anmani chong leimasang khachu, &lt;&lt;Pasal inkhat ning kinthen na jedet inkhat amije a anumei kha akinthen pui nasik Moses ning chong aleipe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nangni hi minjetna ninkintet jarra hiwa Dan hi Moses ning aleimije e. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Aph 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char></note> Tak akinphut bi a, abol minphut phakhan, &lt;Pathien ning pasal inkhat le numei inkhat abol,&gt; Chongkintheng ning aleiril. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aph 2:24</ref></char></note>&lt;Khawa jarra khan Pasal ning apa le anu ada a khan anumei le ankinchun sik e,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscripts alek a chu kinchal mak khan </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anumei le ankinchun sik e.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>khan inni ngaikha inkhat anchang sik.&gt; Khawa jarra anmani kha inni chang muk jei, tak inkhat bei anchang je. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Khan Pathien ning aminchun je kha, miring tute ning khoithen muru su.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Anmani ning insung anheilut karra, thiemroi ngaining Jesu deng khawa chong chungchang anleirakal. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Cor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note> Jesu ning anmanideng aleirilpe, &lt;&lt;Pasal ning anumei akinthen pui-a khan numei alop a-ompui inchu anumei engset a akajong e. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Khale akin anga, numei ning arother akinthen pui-a khan pasal alop a-ompui inchu arother engset a akajong e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning naipang ngai ralwantha ape</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Mi alek ning naipang ngaikha Jesu ning anchung a akut ada nasik anhei roi, tak thiemroi ngaining mi ngaikha anleiren. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Jesu ning khawa amu karra, ama aranga athiemroi ngaideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Naipang ngaikha kei komodonna hongrusu, anmanikha khap muru, ajarchu Pathien Rengram kha anmani kupo ang ta e. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref></char></note>Keining akidiktak a kinirilpe e atu achang inum Pathien Rengram kha hiwa naipang inkhat kupo a aralang mak mikha khawa muna khan lut noning.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Khan Jesu ning naipang ngai kha akako-a, anmani rikip chunga akut ada a, khan ralwantha aleipe.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikanei pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Jesu ning akase alei phut nok a, mi inkhat ning amadeng ahong taan a, amai kunga ahong kinkun a, khan amadeng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Akatha Oja, kumsot ringna chan nasik keining ang-mo kotho sik e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Jesu ning amadeng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Angsik mo keihi akatha nanakoi e? Pathien elei-a akatha atute om mak. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Hon 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Dan 5:16-20</ref></char></note>Nang ning chongpena kha najet: &lt;Mi that moro, jong moro, muruk moro, akidik mak ning mi maher moro; mi rilset moro; nanu napa chong juiro.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Mipa khaning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Oja, hiwa chongpena rikip ngai hichu kisin lai ria kahei jui ijei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Jesu ning ama minreng pum a a-en kang a, amadeng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nang nupui tuk mak na inkhat bei a-om. Se ro khan nanei rikip kha wajor ro, khana sara akapong ngaideng sumsan wapero, khanna nang ning marwan na nei le hoina nanei sik; Khan hong inlang kunuk nujuiro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Mipa ning kha ajet karra, amaiso tai mak je, khan mulung kopong tak a alei se je, ajarchu mipa kha mikanei tak e.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Jesu ning athiemroi ngai a-en kiwel a anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Mikanei ngai Pathien Rengram lut sik hi kho-ongtuk a akintet mi je!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Thiemroi ngai kha khawa chong khaning anmulung alei katok je, tak Jesu ning ahei rilnok a, &lt;&lt;Naipang ngai, Pathien Rengram lut sik hi khongtuk a akintet mi je! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Mikanei inkhat ning Pathien Rengram lut sik khanek a simphoi khur a Satingkui alut sik khaning abeidet.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Chong kha anjet karra thiemroi ngai anleingak detje khan inkhat le inkhat anlei kin rakal je, &lt;&lt;Khan atu ning mi anuhuk tor sik?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Jesu ning anmani ahei en-ngang a aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Hiwa hi miring sik a chu e tormak tak Pathien sik a chu aki e tormak om mak; Pathien sik a chu ang rikip a-ithei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Khan Peter ning ati, &lt;&lt;Enro, keinining ang rikip kinmathaanna nunuk kinjui e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Adik, khana kei ning hi kini rilpe e, kei sik a le chongkahoi sik jarra, atu inum a-inn, ulenai, anu-apa, anaite ngai khanna leipuk akamoso je mikha, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>atun khang a hin akakhel det a apha sik e. Anmani ning reikhat kikhel inn, ulenai, nu le pa, salenai, khan leipuk anpha sik, khan pongna num amu sik; khan akahong sik khang a chu kumleiko ringna kha anchen sik e. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Lk 13:30</ref></char></note>Takkha atun ma kakei katamtak ning nuk akintong sik, khan nuk akintong katamtak ning ma ankei sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning athi sik chong woithum changna aril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Atun Jesu le ama thiemroi ngai Jerusalem lampui chungteng anleikal. Jesu ning athiemroi ngai nek a ma aleikei, khan anmani ning anleingak, khan anuk kujui alek ning chu mulung dongna le china anleinei. Woikhat nok Jesu ning athiemroi somle-inni ngaikha munlop tenga aroi je, khan achunga akosuok sik omchen aleiminjet. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>&lt;&lt;Rangai ru,&gt;&gt; amaning anmanideng ati, &lt;&lt;Eini Jerusalem teng nise sik khawa munna Miring Sapa kha thiempu chungnung ngaile Dan oja ngai kut chunga akinpe sik. Anmani ning amakha thatnasik a anthosik khan Jat-lop ngai kut chunga anpe suok sik, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>anmunui pui sik, anmichil thon sik, anrachak sik, khan anthat sik; tak nithumsoli aheiring nok sik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">James Le John nina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Khan Zebedee naite ngai James le John Jesu deng anhonga. Anmani ning anleiti, &lt;&lt;Oja, keini sik angmikhat nanatho pesik kinmonom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>&lt;&lt;Khawa khachu angmi?&gt;&gt; Jesu ning anmanideng aleirakal.<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Anmani ning anleimasang, &lt;&lt;Narengram kulur nakhan nareng kin-ongna chunga nikin ong kar, keini inni inkhat nachangteng khan inkhat nawoiteng nini min-ong sik a kinmonom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:50">Lk 12:50</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nangni ning ninini kha nangni ning jetmuk chu. Keining ki-in sik pongna hai kha nangni nin-intor sik mi? Kei baptized kotho anga nangni nintho tor sik mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>&lt;&lt;Kintor sik,&gt;&gt; tia anleimasang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nangni ning kei ki-in hai kha nin in sik khan kei baptized katho anga nintho sik e. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Takkha kei kachangteng le kawoiteng kin-ong nasik kadangna khachu keining tormang. Hiwa mun hichu Pathien ning anompe mi ngaideng ape sik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Alak thiemroi som ngaikha khawa chongkha anjet karra, James le John chunga anrang nom je. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Lk 22:25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char></note> Khawa jarra Jesu ning ankholo tal amadeng akoi-a aleiti, &lt;&lt;Jat-lop waikaron kin-e akiti ngai khaning anmi ngai chunga ranak annei, khana lamkakei ngai num pui kutuk a ranak annei. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lk 22:26</ref> </char></note> Kha achang inum, nangni karra chu kha imak. Ninkarra inkhat ning akalok achang nom inchu, alak ngaiseng sok anchang sik e; <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>khan ninkarra inkhat ning ma akei nom inchu, mi rikip sok achang sik e. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Ajarchu Miring Sapa kha ama sepa minthosik akahong imak; mikatamtak ngai sepa thosik le katansuok sik aringkho kape sik a akahong e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning mitkacho Bartimaeus amindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Khan anmani ning Jericho kutung anheiwa, khan Jesu le ama thiemroi ngaile mipuingaile kinroi a Jericho ria anhongsouk lai, Timaeus Sapa Bartimaeus mitkacho kutkodopa kha lampui kolla alei kin ong. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Nazareth Jesu a-e ti ajet karkhan, ama aka-ong aphut je, &lt;&lt;Jesu! David Sapa! Kei niminreng ro!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Mi katamtak ning anlei ren khan a-om chen nasik anleiti. Tak amaning rasa kusuokdet a alei ong, &lt;&lt;David Sapa, kei niminreng ro!&gt;&gt; aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Jesu ning alei ngir a aleiti, &lt;&lt;Heikoi ru.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Khawa jarra anmani ning mitkachopa kha anlei koi. &lt;&lt;Rokpui ro! Kinding ro, amaning nang anakoi hi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Amaning apon aheikalek a, ahei kinchomma, khan Jesu deng aheiwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Jesu ning aleirakal. &lt;&lt;Angmo nangsik a kei ninimin thonom?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">&lt;&lt;Oja, Kei kimit kumunom nok,&gt;&gt; tia amit kachopa khaning aleimasang.<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Jesu ning amadeng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Setro,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nataksen khaning nang animindam e je.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Khawa laitak khan amaning amit aleimu a khan lampui a Jesu nuk aleijui je.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Kulurtak a Jesu Jerusalem alut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Anmani Jerusalem anheinai a, Bethphage le Bethany khopui modonna, Olive chingtang a anhong je. Jesu ning ama thiemroi inni ma aleitir <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>hi-ang hin aleiti: &lt;&lt;Ninma kho-a se ru, son nintung ri Salungdai atute ning anluchong mak inkhat ankhit ninmu sik. Khawa kha heisut inlang hin heikei ru. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Khan atumi inkhat ning, &lt;Ang sik mi kha nintho e?&gt; anahei ti inchu, Akupu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akupu.</char></note> ning a aneiman nomna aom, khan aheithak nok kalen sik tiru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Khana anmani ning anse-a lamsir-a Salungdai inkhat innkol anleikhit kha anleimu, Anmani ning ansut lai, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>khawa khan akingir alek ngaining anmanideng anleirakal, &lt;&lt;Angsik mo Salungdai ninsut e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Anmani ning anleimasang Jesu ning aleiminjet na ang a, khan alei kingir ngai khaning anlei minchoi je. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Anmanining salungdai kha Jesu deng anhei roi-a, achunga anpon ngai salungdai chunga andap a, khan Jesu ning salungdai chunga aleichuong. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Mi katamtak ngaining lampui a anpon anpha a, alek ngaining lei kolla thingbaak anwatuk a khan lampui-a anleipha pe. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Laa 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note>Khan amadonna akase le anuk kujui mingai khaning an-ong anleiphut, &lt;&lt;Pathien minpak ru! Puma riming a akahong amakha amachal atha! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Akahong sik nipa Reng David rengram kha Pathien ning ralwantha pe rase. Pathien minpak ru!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Jesu Jerusalem aheilut a, Bek-inn sunga alut a, khan amaning ang rikip a-en. Tak kholei ahongtung je jarra athiemroi somle-inni ngai le Bethany teng anleisuok je.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning theichang kung ahakser</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18">Mat 21:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Ajing kini-a, anmani ning Bethany ria anhong kir nok a, Jesu awon aleicham je. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Akalaktak ria theichang kung abo kinbur inkhat aleimu, akara ngaikha a-om sik mi tia aka-en alei se. Tak amun atung karra, abo bei awamu je, ajarchu theichang ngai kinra pha lei imak. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Jesu ning theichang kung deng khan aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nakara atute ning bak nok rang muru su!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Khan ama thiemroi ngaining achongril kha anlei jet.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Bek-inn aleise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Anmani Jerusalem anheitung karra, Jesu Bek-inna aleise, Bek-inna neinak akajor le akaracho ngaiseng kha akaholsuok aleiphut jei. Amaning sumsan kuthul ngai le pharphili kajor ngai ankin-ongna ngai kha amalet pe je, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>khan Bek-inn sumpuk kutung khan neinak kuchoi atute inkhat num leiminlut mak je. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Is 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char></note>Jesu ning khawa so-a mingai deng aminchu je: &lt;&lt;Khachu hiwa anghin akinje khachu Pathien ning aleiti, &lt;Kei bek-inn hi jat rikip ngai nina inn akinti sik e.&gt; Tak nangni ning muruk kinthupna ninminchang je!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Thiempu kolok ngai le Dan oja ngaining khawakha anjet je, khawa jarra ama that nasik a lampui aka-entok anphut jei. Anmani ning amakha anchi, ajarchu mipui ngai ning ama minchuna kha kinlak anleisak.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Kholei aheitung a, Jesu le ama thiemroi ngai khopui kha anleimathaan jei.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Theichang kung ri-a kinchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Jingteng ma, anmani lampui a anse lai, theichang kung kha anleimu. Khawakha arujung kutung a aleichar je. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Peter ning omchen akosuok kha amindon na Jesu deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Oja, Enro, nahakser theichang kung kha achar je!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Pathien taksen na nei ru. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Cor 13:2</ref></char></note>Keining akidiktak kiniril pe e, atu-tu inum hiwa chingbung hi kinphuk inlang tui-ongpui lai-a tanasik chong ape a khan amulung kei-chi o na neilei-a, takkha aril na chung a asuok nger sik tia akataksen mi khadeng akintho sik e. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Khawa jarra kini minjet e: nangni ning Pathien nina ninnei a angmikhat ninni karra, kinmu je tia taksen ru, khan ninni rikip ngaikha akinpe sik e. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mat 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:15">15</ref></char></note>Khan ningir a Pathien deng nina ninnei karra, marwan na akaom Ninpa khaning nintho thel ngairikip ana rangai mindam nasik a, atumi inkhat chung a mulung hoimak na ninnei rikip kha rangai mindam ru.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscripts alek a alam 26 akinchal: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Milak ninrangai mindam mak inchu, marwan a akaom ninpa ning nangni thothel na ngai rangai mindam nape noning </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Mat 6:15 a anri) </char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu thotorna chungchang rakalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Anmani Jerusalem a woikhat anhong tung nok je. Khanna Jesu kha Bek-inn sunga aleilon lai, thiempu kolok, Dan oja ngai khan upa ngai amadenga anlei hong <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>khan amadeng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Hiwa ngai thotor nasik a ang ranak mo nanei? Hiwa thotorna hi atu ningmo anape e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Keining chong inkhatbei narakal kate, khan nangning khawa kha nana masang inchu, keining ang thotorna ngai ningmo hiwa ngai hi kathotor e ti kini minjet sik. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>John ning baptized thotorna ranak anei kha khona ria mi, niti pe ru: Pathien ria a-imakli miring ria mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Anmani inkhat le inkhat ankinkher phut je: &lt;&lt;Angmi niti sik? &lt;Pathien ria e,&gt; niti inle kha amaning, &lt;Kha-inchu angsik mo John kha taksen lei nin e?&gt; ati sik. <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Takkha miring ria niti inum&gt;&gt; (Anmani ning mipui ngai kha anlei chi, ajarchu mi rikip ning John kha chongkachoi pa e tia anlei.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Khawa jarra anmani ning Jesu deng aleimasang khachu, &lt;&lt;Keini jet mung.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kha inchu, kisintho ngai hi ang thotorna ningmo katho e nangnideng niminjet noning.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Theiburbil kasaal ngai chongtekak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Is 5:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 5:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Khan Jesu ning anmanideng chongtekak ngai aleirilpe: &lt;&lt;Pha inkhat a theiburbil kiling mi inkhat aleiom, theiburbil sarapal aleikhar, theibur musorna sik khur inkhat aleichei, khanna berte inkhat aleibol, Khan atheiburbil kha akotho ngaideng asaljei khana a-inn amusoli khomol asejei. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Theibur khekpha kha ahongtung pha, amaning asok inkhat theiburbil kasaal ngaideng asaal kalei sik aleitir. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Theiburbil kasaal ngai khaning asuokpa kha ansurra anleirachak, inkhatte palei a antir je. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Khan theiburbil kupu khaning asok lop inkhat atir nok, theiburbil kasaal ngai khaning alu anlei rachak a kinjak anleipe. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Akupu khaning suok lop inkhat atir nok, khan anmani ning amakha anlei that jei; khanna alak katam tak num kha-angkhan anlei tho jei, alekning anlei rachak, alekning an leithat jei. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Tir sik-a inkhat bei akaom khachu asapa mirittak kha e, Atorna tak a asapa kha theiburbil kasaal ngai deng atir jei. Amaning aleiti, &lt;Kasapa hichu anmani ning anlei kaja nger sik tia kikin ngam.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Takkha theiburbil kasaal ngai khaning inkhat le inkhat anlei kinbek, &lt;Amahi theiburbil kupupa sapa e. Hongru that ri, khanna amaning phasik rikip hi einita achang sik jei!&gt; anti <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Khawa jarra anmani ning sapa kha ansurra anthat je khanna akithi kha theiburbil ralteng andengjon jei.<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>&lt;&lt;Kha achang inchu theiburbil kupupa khaning angmo atho sik jei?&gt;&gt; tia Jesu ning aleirakal. &lt;&lt;Ama ahong sik khan theiburbil kasaal ngaikha athat sik je khanna theiburbil kha milop deng aminsaal nok sik jei. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Laa 118:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:23">23</ref></char></note>Akidik tak a hiwa chongkintheng hi nin leipa sik je?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Inn kasak ngai ning thamakjei tia andengjon lungkha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">ankarra apui koron achang je.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Hiwa hi Puma ning atho e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">Eini mit mu-a kho-ongtuk a akinlak mi!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Jehudi lamkakei ngai khaning Jesu sur sik a anlei kin thok e, ajarchu amaning chongtekak aleitho ngai kha anmani chung nga aril e ti hi anleijet. Takkha anmani ning mipui ngaikha anleichi, khawa jarra amakha anlei mathaanli anse jei.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ramsel pesik chungchanga rakalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Jesu deng chong anrakalli surna sik a, Pharisees alek le Herod mingai alek amadeng aleitir. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Anmanining amadeng anhonga anleiti, &lt;&lt;Oja nangning mingai modonna inkhatte chilei-a akidik niril hi kinjet. Nangning atute mai enmak che, takkha mingai sik-a Pathien lungdo kha akidik a nalei minchu. Khanna Caesar denga ramsel pesik hi eini Dan akoi mi? Nipe sik mi? Nipe mak sik mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Takkha Jesu ning anmani changkam kha ajet a aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Angsik mo kei niminkhit sik niti e? Roman sumsan inkhat kha heichoi ru, khan keining enkate.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Anmanining sumsan inkhat anhei choi, khan amaning aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Tu milim le riming mo akinje e?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">&lt;&lt;Caesar&gt;&gt; tia anleimasang.<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Jesu ning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Caesar takha Caesar peru, khan Pathien takha Pathien deng peru.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Khana anmani ning Jesu kha anleingak je.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thi ria ringnok chungchanga rakalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Sin 23:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Khan Sadducee alekning, miring hi thi ria ring noning je akiti ngai, Jesu deng anhonga anleiti, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Dan 25:5</ref></char></note> &lt;&lt;Oja, Moses ning hiwa dan hi keini sik-a aleimije: &lt;Mi inkhat athi-a naite neilei-a anumei aleida inchu, anaipa inkhatning churmeinu kha aom pui nger sik, khawa jarra anmani inni annei naite ngai kha akithipa naite e tia anlei thei nasik e.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Pha inkhat a unai sari anlei om; upa tak khaning numei anei je khana naite neilei-a athi je. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Khan inni changnapa khaning numei kha aom puinok je, ama khanum naite nei lei-a athi nok je. Khanna inthum changnapa annaipa khanum kha-ang tit a asuok nok je, <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>khana alak ngaiseng: unai sari khaning num numei nu kha an ompui rip a naite nei lei-a anthi rip je. Atorna tak a, numei nu khanum athi je. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Atunchu, akithi rikip ringnok ning nikho khan khawanu kha atu numei mo achang sik e? Anmani sari ning numeinu kha an lei ompui rip.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Kho-ongtuk a nintho thel ije! Khana angsik jar mi ti hi ninjet mi? Hiwa hi nangni ning chongkintheng le Pathien ranak kha ninjet mak jarra e. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Ajarchu akithi ngai kha anringnok pha, anmani ngai kha marwan tirle kupo anchang sik jei khan innei omno ning jei. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Hon 3:6</ref></char></note> Atunchu, akithi ngai anthei sik jarra: Moses jedet rubu a thingbur meikachoong chong akinje kha pangai lei mo nin e? Khawa khan hi-ang akinje tichu Pathien ning Moses deng, &lt;Kei Abraham Pathien, Isaac Pathien, khanna Jacob Pathien ki-e,&gt; ati. <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Amahi akiring ngai Pathien e, akithi ngai Pathien imak. Nangni ninthel rangra jei!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chongpena koloktak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lk 10:25-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dan oja inkhat ahong a anmani ankinbek kha alei rangai. Jesu ning Sadducees ngai deng chong katha masang kha aleimu. Khawa jarra akolla ahonga chong aleirakal: &lt;&lt;Chongpena karra kho khamo akolok tak e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:4">Dan 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 6:5">5</ref></char>
    </note> Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt; &lt;Israel ngai rangai ru! Puma eini Pathien bei kha e ni Puma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Puma eini Pathien bei kha e ni Puma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a-imakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Puma kha-e ei-ni Pathien, Puma inkhat bei-e.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Puma ni Pathien kha numulung pumpui, naratha pumpui a, nimindonna pumpui, khanna naranak ratna pumpui ning minreng ro.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Thm 19:18</ref></char></note> Khanna inni changna chongpena koloktak khachu: &lt;Nang nabinga nikinreng anga nokho niweng minreng ro.&gt; Hiwa inni ngai kikhella chongpena kolok alop om-mak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:35">Dan 4:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dan oja khaning Jesu deng aleiril, &lt;&lt;Oja! Nangning akidik a niriljei, khachu Puma khabei e Pathien, ama ilei a alop Pathien ommak. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref></char></note>Khan Pathien kha numulung pumpui, nimindonna pumpui khan naranak ratna pumpui a minrengro, khan nibing a nikinreng anga nokho niweng minrengro, Hiwa chongpe inni kujui hining Pathien deng ran le kinthoina kapenek a mei a natak pumpui aro minkang nek a atha det.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Amaning kinsing thei tak a amasang kha Jesu ning amupha, amadeng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nang Pathien Rengram ria akalak ommak che.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Khanchu atute ning Jesu deng chong rakal tor muk jei.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Messiah chungchang rakalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Jesu ning Bek-inn sunga aminchu lai, chong aleirakal, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Dan oja ngaining Messiah kha David sonlepar kha e tia kho-ongmo anti thei?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Laa 110:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ratha Kintheng ning David murtak a amin rilsuok:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">&lt;Puma khaning kei Puma deng aleiti:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">Ninkin muda ngaikha nike thoi a kada mak kar seng</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">kachang teng hin kin ongro</char>&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>
    <char style="wj">David khet ning amakha &lt;Puma&gt; tia akoi; achang inchu kho-ongmo Messiah kha David sonlepar achang thei sik?</char>&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 12:37">Jesu ning dan Oja ngai renna</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Lk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Khana mipui ngaining Jesu chong kha rokpui a anlei rangai. <verse eid="MRK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Jesu ning anmani aminchu a anmanideng aleiril, &lt;&lt;Dan Oja ngai ri a kinsing thei ru, songkol kasei akinhak a akolon nom ngaikha keithella amin kajanom <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>khan synagogues le bak minchunna mun kahoitak khan akin ongnom. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Anmani ning Churmei ngai ria nemna an-entok khan insung neinak ngai anlei-leipe, mi musik a Pathien nina kosot tak a anleinei. Anmani kha karakna akakhel anpha sik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Churmeinu sumsanpe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Lk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Jesu kha sumsan dana mudonna akin ong lai mipui ngai sumsan minbuk na pelom kosuok anpe kha a-enlai mikanei katamtak ngai ning sumsan akatampui anlei mata; <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>khan sara churmeinu inkhat num ahong a ana inni sumsan inkhat dam awothun minlut. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Jesu ning athiemroi ngai akoi mintup a anmanideng aleiril, &lt;&lt;keining akidik tak kinirilpe hiwa sara churmeinu ning sumsan minbukna akape ngai seng karra akatam akape kha e. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Ajarchu alop ngai seng khaning akatam annei na ria ankhoi then li anpe e, takkha hiwa nu ning asara chang aneiseng, aringna sik a aminbuk rikip kha ape e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Bek-inn ahongkoi sik Jesu ning aril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Mat 24:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Lk 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Jesu ning Bek-inn ria aheisuok pha, thiemroi inkhat ning amadeng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Enro, Oja! Lung ngaile innpui ngaihi kho-ongtuk a ennom kaom mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Innpui kolok ansak ngaihi ninmu mi? Lung ngai hi inkhat nak num an omna ria leida noning; hi ngai rikip hi alachim sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pongna le Jengna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Bek-inn ralkhat teng Jesu kha Olive Chingtang chunga alei kin ong, Khawa pha Peter, James, John khan Andrew ruk-a amadeng anleihong. <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>&lt;&lt;Hiwa hi angtuk karra mo asuok sik e niminjet ro,&gt;&gt; anmanining anleiti, &lt;&lt;khana hi seng ahongsuok sik pha kha ahongtung jei ti hi jetna sik angmo ahongsuok sik nirilpero.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kinsing thei ru, khan atu khat ning nangni akalet teng ana roimak nasik tho ru. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Mi katamtak ning, kei kiriminga anheiwa antisik, &lt;Kei amakha ki-e!&gt; khan mi katamtak ngaining akalet lampui a anroi sik. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Raal kindei le, raal chong kinthang ninjet phakhan chimuru. Khawa kha ahongsuok nger sik e, takkha atorna li-imak. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Ajarchu jat inkhat le inkhat anhong kinsol sik; khan Rengram inkhat le inkhat raal ankin dei sik. Amun rikip a ringnu akinnok sik, khan bak le in aboi sik. Kha ngai kha nai neisik teng naiha kuphu akana kinphutna pong anga a-e sik.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mat 10:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Lk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref> </char>
    </note> &lt;&lt;Nangni ninbing a nin kin singthei nger sik e. Nangni anasur sik khan chongtan na munna ana keiso sik. Synagogues a nangni anarachak sik; kei sik a waikaron ngaile rengngai maikunga ninlangir sik e, Chongkahoi anmanideng ninril jarra e. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Tak atorna ahong tung makma chongkahoi hi mi rikip deng ninril nger sik e. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Khana nangni anasur a khan chongtan na mun na anaroi sik, angmo kiril sik tia khawa pha khan ninmulung mindongmuru; apha kha ahong tung sung a chong akinpe ngai kha ril ru. Ajarchu nangni ninril sik chong kha nangni ria imak; ratha kintheng ria akahong suok sik e. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Mingai ning ulenai tak kha that sik a anpesuok sik, khanna Pa ngaining num anaite ngai kha kha-ang khan anthosik. Sa le nai ngaining num Nu le Pa ngai chunga anranga that nasik anpesuok sik. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref></char></note> Kei jarra mi rikip ning nangni anahal sik. Tak atu inum ahekna kutung angirtor inchu hukna achen sik e.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinrimna chi ka-om tak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dn 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char>
    </note> &lt;&lt;Kinrimna Chikaom tak kha, a-om makna sik mun a ahong ngirkha ninmu sik.&gt;&gt; Akapasuok khaning ang tina mi jet thei rase! &lt;&lt;Khawa phakhan Judea ram a kaom ngaikha Chingteng taan rang rusu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Lk 17:31</ref> </char></note> Inn chunga akaom mi khaning insunga aneinak kalei sik ahongchumli apha minmang marase. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Khan leipuk a akaom mi khaning apon kalei sik a-inna hei kir-rang ma rase. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Khawa phakhan nai koron ngai le naidong kanei sik a angtuk a chikaom sik mi! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Hingai hi phelbi lai asuok mak nasik Pathien nina neiru! <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dn 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Rev 7:14</ref></char></note> Ajarchu khawa kini ning a kinrimna ngaikha, Pathien ning Leithoichung abol phut lim ria kinphut atun kutunga miring ngai anjet kinrimna ngai, hiwa anghi ret suoknok no ningjei. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Takkha Puma ning khawa kini ngaikha aminbong je; aminbong mak inchu, atute ringtor noning. Ama kadangsuok ngai sik jarra kini ngai kha amintom det e.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>&lt;&lt;Khawa jarra tu achang inum mi inkhat ning, &lt;Enru, Messiah kha hin a-om!&gt; a-imakli, &lt;Enru, son-na a-om!&gt; antia achang inum taksen muru. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Messiah akidikmak ngaile akidikmak pathien chongkachoi ngai anhong kinlarsik. Anmani ning sinkinlak le ngakna angjet anthosik khan a-ithei inchu Pathien akadangjei mi ngainum akalet teng roina sik antho sik e. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Kinsing theitak a omru! Apha kha aheitung maklai angrikip kini minjet ijei.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miring Sapa hongnasik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Is 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eze 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Rev 6:12</ref></char>
    </note>&lt;&lt;Khawa pongnapha nikho ator inchu kini kha ajingsik, tha kha war noning je, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Is 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Rev 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2:10</ref></char></note>arsi ngaikha marwan ria anhong ta sik, khanna boirok a akaom ngai kha ahong kinnok sik. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dn 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Rev 1:7</ref></char></note> Khan Miring Sapa kha ahong kinlar sik, alurna thotorna le kinroi a Sumphai chunga ahong chum sik. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Khan akadang so sa ngai akoi mintup nasik marwan tirle ngai leithoichung rikil minli amor inkhat teng ria aphut a inkhat teng kutung amaning atir sik je.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Theichang kung ria kinchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>&lt;&lt;Theichang kung ria kinchuna neiru. Theichang abaak ngai ahong em a ajik ahong cher a khan abo ther ahongsuok inchu, kholum pha anai je ti hi nangni ning ninjet. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Khawa le akin angrip a, hiwa omchen ngai hi ahongsuok ninmu je inchu, apha anai je, ahong nasik akinthok je.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">apha anai je, ahong nasik akinthok je </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a-imakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama ahong nai je, hong nasik akinthok je.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Akidik a keining nangni deng kinitipe e, miring akaring ngai anthiso maklai omchen rikip hi asuok sik e. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Marwan le Leithoichung chu akin mang sik, takkha Kei kachong chu kinmang phit noning.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atute ning kini le pha kha jetmuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note> &lt;&lt;Khawa Kini le pha kha, marwan tirle ngai ning num, khan asapa ning num atute ning jetmuk, Apa bei ning ajet e. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Kinsing thei tak a kinrin chak ru, ajarchu apha kha angtuk karra mo ahongtung sik nangni ning jet muk chu. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Lk 12:36-38</ref></char></note> Mi inkhat ning khomol sik a inn adadoi pha, asok ngai ansin thosik ape-a, inkhar kangakpa deng kinrinchak nasik chong ape ang kupo e. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Khawa jarra kinrinchak ru, ajarchu inn kupupa kha kholei achanga, janchim achanga, jintengma a-imakli sun achanga angtuk karra mo ahong sik nangni ning jetmuk chu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Jet lei thei lei-a ama ahong tung inchu, najal naom kha numu marase. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Khan nangdeng kiril hi mi rikip deng kiti e: Kinrin chak ru!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesu thatna sik kinsepna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Lk 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Hon 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini makma Rakan Reikahoi le cholphillei waipol, Thiempu kolok ngai le Dan oja ngai ning Jesu kha ruk a surna sik khan that nasik lampui anlei entok. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Anmani ning anleiti, &lt;&lt;Hiwa reikahoi sunga hinchu thomiri, lakanchu mipui kinhangna ahong e thei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bethany a Jesu sarek ankanot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37">Lk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char>
    </note>Bethany khopui-a chi kaomtak ri kaphar aleikoron Simon inna Jesu kha bu abak a alei omlai, numeisa inkhat lungwar ning anbol akok kisip akintheng nard kung ria ansom amankatam sarek anchoi a anheiwa. Khawanu ning sarek kok kha amalong a sarek rim kahoi kha jesu luchunga aleibun. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Khawa mun na mi alekchu anmulung aleithei a inkhat le inkhat anlei kinbek a anleiril, &lt;&lt;Sarek rim kahoi aminmang hi anemna angmi? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Hiwa Sarek hi sumsan reijathum kikhella nijor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sumsan</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: anri 6:37</char></note> thei e khan sumsan kha sara khodeng kathei ngai pethei e!&gt;&gt; khana numeinu kha anlei rilset je.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Tak Jesu ning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Khawanu kha abinga daru! Angsik mo ninkachok e? Numeinu hi ning akathatak kei sik a sin atho e. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Dan 15:11</ref></char></note>Sara ngai chu nangnile nin ompui chak sik, nangni ning nin monom pha rikip a nin sen thei e. Takkha kei chu nangni le pha rikip a ombung nomin. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Khawanu ning ator seng kha atho e; Sarek rim kahoi kuchunga akanot hi kikinphum ning sik makma anakanot ijei. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Tunchu, akidik tak a kini rilpe hi-e simleichung pumpui chongkahoi kinrilna munna, khawanu ning aleitho ngaikha ama mindonna le kinroi a akinril sik e je.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Judas ning Jesu pesuoksik awanom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Khan thiemroi somle inni ngai karra Judas Iscariot antipa khaning Jesu pesuok nasik thiempu kolok ngai deng alei se je. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Anmani ning achong kha anjet pha anlei rokpui, sumsan pesik a kintepna annei je. Khawa jarra Judas khaning Jesu kha anmanideng pesuok thei nasik lampui alei-entok je.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning athiemroi ngai rakan reikahoi bu abakpui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Lk 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Chol phillei Waipol reihoi nikho amasatak ning, Rakan reikahoi bak nasik keelmong ngai that ning nikho khan, Jesu thiemroi ngaining anleirakal, &lt;&lt;Rakan rei bakbung nasik nangni jarra khon mo kinbol sik a nomonom?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Khan Jesu ning ankarra miring inni aleitirra hi-ang aleiminjet: &lt;&lt;Nangni khopui a son seru, khanna tuibel kodom mi inkhat ninkin tongpui sik. Ama kunuk kha jui ru <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Ama lutna inn, kupupa deng khan tiru: &lt;Oja ning ka thiemroi ngai le kei Rakan reikahoi kinbak nasik inn kha khon mi?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Khawa pha amaning inn chungden kolok tak, aminleng sa inkhat ani min musik, khanna khan ang rikip eini sik a ninmintuk sik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Khawa munkha athiemroi ngai anlei mathaanli, khopui teng anlei se jei, khanna Jesu ning aminjet ang kopo-a angrikip anwamu je; khana Rakan reikahoi bakbung nasik a anmintuk je.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Kholei ahong tung pha, Jesu ning thiemroi somle inni ngai le an hong jei. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Laa 41:9</ref></char></note> Anmani ning dokhang chunga anbak lai, Jesu ning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Akidik tak a kini rilpe e ninkarra kei le kinbakbung inkhat ning kei anape suok sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Athiemroi ngai ning anmulung aleidong a, inkhat soli inkhat ning, &lt;&lt;Kei nini tina chu imak nu, a-e mi?&gt;&gt; antia amadeng anleirakal.<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Nangni somle inni karra inkhat, Kei le waipol kheeng sunga kinthun bungpa hi e. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Chong kinthenga aleikinje ang a, Miring Sapa kha athi nger sik e; takkha miring sapa akapesuok sik mipa kha angtuk mo amachal kase-e! Ama sik a alei kinte mak ning atha det sik e!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Puma janbu bakminchunna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Cor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Anmani ning anbak lai, Jesu ning Waipol her kha alei a Pathien nina le minpakna anei a, aher akhoi a, khan a thiemroi ngai deng aleipe, &lt;&lt;Kinlei ru, hiwahi kataksa e,&gt;&gt; aleiti.<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Khan amaning hai kha alei a, Pathien minpakna anei a anmanideng aleipe; khana richu ankholo a anlei in. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Hon 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char></note>Jesu ning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Hiwa hi mi katamtak sik a akolong, Pathien le kinnomna jetnasik kithisen kha e. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Akidik tak kiniril pe e, Pathien Rengram ma theiburju ther kha ki-in mak karseng hiwa theiburju hi inno ning jei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Khan anmani ning laa ansak a, Olive chingtang teng anleise jei.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning Peter akinlep sik arildik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zec 13:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nangni ninkholo a nintaan sik khanna kei nana mathaan sik je, ajarchu chong kintheng ning ati, &lt;Pathien ning keelmong kakhal pa kha athat sik, khan keelmong ngaikha ankin chek chai sik jei.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28:16</ref></char></note> Tak kei hi akiringa kathei nok li, Galilee a ninma a kalei se sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Peter ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Alak ngai sengning analei mathaan inum keining chu nada phit noning!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Jesu ning Peter deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Keining nangdeng akidik tak kiniril pe e, atun jan tak hin arkhong ning woini akinram mak lai woithum rak kei hi jetmang niti sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Peter ning rasa kanger det-a aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Nang le nithi bung sik achang inum, kha-ang chu tiphit noning!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Khana thiemroi ankholo-a kha-anga anlei ti rip.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning Gethsemane a Pathien nina aleinei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Anmani ning Gethsemane anti munkhan anhong je, khan Jesu ning thiemroi ngai deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Pathien nina kanei lai hiwa hin kin-ong ru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Amaning Peter, James le John aleiroi. Khana kinrimna le mulung pongna achunga ahong tung je, <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>khana amaning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kumulung hi adong hei-a thina sik kutung a ije. Hinnahin om inlang kinrinchak ru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Alek akalak det ase a, leithoi a akinbok-a, a ithei sik inchu khawa mulung pongna kha ama chunga asuok mak nasik a aleini. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Amaning aleini, &lt;&lt;Apa, Kapa! Nang sik-a angrikip a-ithei rip. Hiwa mulung pongna hai hi kei ria nakhek pe ro. Khanum kei lungdo ilei a, nang nulungdo e rase.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Khan ama ahong kirra thiemroi inthum ngai anleijal kha aleimu. Amaning Peter deng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Simon, nang najal mi je? Pung khatbei sik num akaher a om torlei mo ni-e?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Khan amaning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kinrinchak ru, mathemna ninta makna sik Pathien nina neiru. Ratha ningchu amonom, tak taksa chu adol.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Ama awasenok li Pathien nina, anga-ngai a aleineinok. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Khan athiemroi ngaideng ahong kirnok a anleijal kha aleimunok; anmit lei malong tormuk. Khana anmani ning anmanideng angmo arilsik leijet mak.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Woithum changna ahong kirnok a, amaning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nangni atun kutung ninlajal a pong ninla minchum mi? Ahun je! Apha kha ahong je! Enru, Miring Sapa kha setna kanei ngai kutchunga akinpe je. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Thei ru, eini se rang ri. Enru, anakape suok sikpa kha hin-na a-om je!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ansur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Jesu ning kha-ang chong arillai, thiemroi somle-inni ngai karra Judas kha ahongtung je. Ama le kinroi-a mipui ngai, Dan Oja ngai, upa ngai chemjamle luchei anchoi a thiempu kolok ngaining anhong tir je. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Akape suokpa khaning mipui ngai kha anjet nasik inkit inkhat aleipe: &lt;&lt;Keining komojop sikpa kha ninmanom pa kha e. Sur ru khan khal inlang keiso ru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Judas ahei tunglimli, Jesu deng ase-a, &lt;&lt;Oja!&gt;&gt; atia awamojop. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Khan anmani ning Jesu kha ansurra khan ankhit tit je. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Tak amadonna akingir mi inkhat ning achemjam aheikalek a, Thiempu chungnung asokpa kuor atuk chet pe je. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Khan Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Muruk malet kusur sik anga chemjam le luchei kinroi-a kei kusur sik ninhong mi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> Aniso nangni le ni-ombunga Bek-inna kiniminchu jet, kei nalei sur muk chu. Tak Chongkintheng khachu pui alatung nger sik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Khan thiemroi rikip ngaining anmathaanli antan del je.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Pon kinnem bei kisil rother inkhat ning Jesu nuk aleijui. Anmani ning amakha sur sik a anleitho, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>tak aponsil kha aleida li aroksai-a aleitaan.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu upa rup ngai maikunga anleiroi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Lk 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Jn 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Khan anmani ning Jesu kha Thiempu Chungnung inna anroi je; khana khan thiempu kolok ngai seng le upa ngai khan Dan oja ngai le anlei kintup. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Peter ning alek kin-karra ahei jui, Thiempu Chungnung tollai sung a aheilut. Khanna khan raalmi ngaile anlei kin onga mei anlei otbung. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Thiempu kolok ngai le ankintup upa ngai seng ning Jesu that theina sik ajar anlei entok, tak inkhat te num leimumuk. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Jesu thothelna wartheng sakhi katamtak anril, tak ansakhi pe ngaikha ite leikin angmak.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Khan mi alek anhei ngir a Jesu thothelna hiwa wartheng sakhi hi anlei pe: <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jn 2:19</ref></char></note> &lt;&lt;Keinining ama atikha kinjet, &lt;Miring ning ansak hiwa bek-inn hi keining kithet sik, khan ni thum so-a miring ning ansak mak inkhat keining kasak sik.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Kha achang inum anmani ngai sakhi pe kha leikin angmuk.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Thiempu Chungnung khaning anmani rikip maikunga angir a Jesu deng chong aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Anmani ning nang chunga thothelna anril hi masang lei sik mo ni-e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Takkha Jesu ning a-omchena chong inkhat lei rilmak. Ret Thiempu chungnung ning Jesu deng arakal nok, &lt;&lt;Nang hi ralwan katha Pathien Sapa Messiah kha mo ni-e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dn 7:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Kei ki-e, khana Miring Sapa kha akarat tak changteng akin-onga khana marwan sumphai le kinroi-a ahong chum kha ninkholo a ninmu rip sik e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Thiempu chungnung khaning apon akeitherra aleiti, &lt;&lt;Eini ning sakhi alop rangai mak je! <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Thm 24:16</ref></char></note> Pathien arildek hi nangni ning ninjet je. Angmo ninmindon e?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Ankholo ning amanom muk jei: anminthel a khan amakha nithat sik e anti.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Alek ning Jesu kha anleimichil thon anleiphut, khan anmani ning amakha amit ankhitpe a anleisuk. &lt;&lt;Najetmi atuning mo anasuk e!&gt;&gt; anmani ning anleiti. Khan raalmi ngaining anleiroi a amakha anleikaben.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter ning Jesu jetmong ati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jn 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Peter kha tollai a aleiom lai, Thiempu chungnung sok numeisa karra inkhat akolla aheiwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Soknu khaning Peter mei a-ot kha amu-a, alei en nganga aleiti, &lt;&lt;Nang num, Nazareth Jesu le ninlei kin roi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Takkha Peter ning alei kinthing phirra aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Angkhami nangning niti kei jetmang,&gt;&gt; khan amaning inkhar tolteng aleise. Khawa laitak khan arkhong kha ahong kinram je.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscripts alak a ommak, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khawa laitak khan arkhong kha ahong kinram je.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Soknu khaning ama amu nok-a amodon na akingir ngaideng khan arilnok, &lt;&lt;Hiwa mipa hi anmani karra inkhat e!&gt;&gt; ati. <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Takkha Peter akinthing phir nok je.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Tomlak soa akolla akingir ngai ning Peter deng anleiti, &lt;&lt;Soilei-a nang anmani karra inkhat ni-e, ajarchu nang Galilee ria ni-e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Khan Peter ning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Kei akidik kiril e, kikin hakser hi-e! Akidik kiril mak inchu Pathien ning nakarak rase! Keining ninril mipa hi jetmang!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Khawa laitak khan arkhong ning woini changna ahong kin ram je, khawa pha Peter deng Jesu ning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Arkhong woini ahong kinram mak lai nangning kei woithum rak jetmang niti sik.&gt;&gt; aleiti kha amindon jei. Khanna ama amulung kintok tak a aleichap.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Pilate maikung anheiroi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Jingteng ma a thiempu kolok ngaining upa ngai, Dan Oja ngai, khan upa rupngai ankholo a kinrangtak a ankintup a khan chong anleimintuk. Anmani ning Jesu kha thirrui a ankhit a anleiroi, khan Pilate kutchunga anleipe. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilate ning chong aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Nang Jehudi ngai Reng mo ni-e?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jesu ning aleimasang, &lt;&lt;Nangning niti kha e je.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Thiempu kolok ngaining Jesu kha akikhella anleirilset, <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>khawa jarra Pilate ning Jesu deng aleirakal nok, &lt;&lt;Nang namasanglei sik mo ni-e? Rangairo anmani rikip ning nuchunga anirilset hi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Jesu ning chongbai khat num leimasang nokmak, khawa jarra Pilate ning aleingak.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu thatnasik chongtan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39--19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Rakan Reikahoi anthoracham ansurra anda ngai karra mipui anmanomna miring inkhat kha Pilate ning aleimoso pe chak. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Khawa lai khan Barabbas anti raalruk ngaile mikathat miring inkhat mikhumna a anlei om. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Mipui ngai kha anhong kintup a aleitho ang a athonoknasik Pilate deng anhongti, <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilate ning anmanideng aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Jehudi ngai Rengpa kha kunumoso pe sik nin monom mi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Thiempu kolok ngaining Jesu chunga thangse annei jarra akut chunga anhei pesuok e ti kha Pilate ning aleijet.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Takkha thiempu kolok ngaining mipui ngai kha anleimathok a, Barabbas pot kha moso nasik a anlei minti. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilate ning mipui deng aleirilnok, &lt;&lt;khachu nangni ning Jehudi ngai Reng tia ninkoi padeng kei angmo ninimintho nom?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Anmani ning anhei ong malet a, &lt;&lt;Cross a makhai ro!&gt;&gt; anti.<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Takkha Pilate ning aleirakal, &lt;&lt;Angsik jarra, amaning ang thothel namo anei e?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Anmani ning akikhella an-onga anleiti, &lt;&lt;Cross a makhai ro!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilate ning mipui mulungkha aleimintai nom jarra Barabbas kha anmani sik a aleimoso pe jei. Khan Jesu kha anrachak a cross a makhai sik a aleipe jei.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Raalmi ngaining Jesu anmunuiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Jn 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Raalmi ngaining Jesu kha Ramkoron pa inn tollai sunga ankei minlut a khan raalmi rikip anlei kinkoichun. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Anmani ning pon sendup akinchuol kha Jesu anleiminsil, liling ria anbol lukhu, kha alu chunga anleiminkhu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Khan anmani ngaining &lt;&lt;Jehudi Rengpa niringsei sot rase!&gt;&gt; tia chibei anleitho. <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Anmani ngaining Jesu lukha luchei ning anleirachak, anleimichilthon, khan ankemorkhup anthep a ankinkun a anleikumuk. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Anmani ning anmunuipui soli, pon sendup akinchuol kha anlik pe a, khan ama pon kha anminsil malet je. Khan cross a makhai thatsik a ankei so je.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu cross a anmakhai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lampui-a anmani ning mi inkhat ariming Simon anti aram ria khopui a akahong anlei kintonga, khan raalmi ngaining amakha namrop a Jesu cross kha anlei mindom. Simon kha Cyrene mi e khana Alexander le Rufus ngai pa e. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Anmani ning Jesu kha Golgotha, hiwa tina chu &lt;&lt;Lusai mun&gt;&gt; antina khan anroi je. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Khana khan theiburju le lei anminchun kha myrrh anti kha min innasik anleitho, tak Jesu khawa kha lei in mak. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Laa 22:18</ref></char></note> Khan Jesu kha cross a anmakhai a ama ponder kha anmani ning anleikinsem, atu ningmo pon kinlek kha anpha sik tia machal anlei-en. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Cross a anmakhai kha jingteng pung ko a-e. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Ama cross chung a engset chonga hi-anghin anleitar: &lt;&lt;JEHUDI NGAI RENGPA.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Ama le kinroi-a muruk inni, inkhat achangteng, inkhat awoiteng cross a anmakhai del.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscripts alak achu alam 28 akinchal: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Raal rup ngai khale aleikinchun bunga Pathien chong akintheng kha pui amintung </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Lk 22:37 enro) </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Is 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Laa 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jn 2:19</ref></char>
    </note> Mi akase akahong ngaining anlu ankalek a chong ero a Jesu deng anleiril: &lt;&lt;O-a! Bek-inn nithet li nithum sunga kasak sik niti khale! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Atun cross chung ria hong chum inlang, nibinga kinhuk rang ro!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Khawa angkhan thiempu kolok ngai le Dan oja ngai ning Jesu anmunui so-a, inkhat le inkhat ankinbek a, &lt;&lt;Amaning milak chu ahuk a, abinga chu kinhuk tor mak! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Messiah Israel ngai Rengpa, cross chung ria atun hongchum ro, khan nahongchum kha kinmuli keini ning nataksen kinte!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Khan cross a ama le anmakhai bung inni ngai khaning num ama anlei ril set.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Sunchimma ram pumpui akijing ning aleimukhu, khawakha pung inthum kutung kha-angkhan aleiti je. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Laa 22:1</ref></char></note> Pung inthum a Jesu rasa kinlaktak a-onga, &lt;&lt;Eloi, Eloi, lema sabachthani?&gt;&gt; ati, hiwa tina chu, &lt;&lt;Ka Pathien, ka Pathien angsikmo kei nana dadoi e?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Khana akaom mi alek ngaining anjet a anti, &lt;&lt;Rangai ru, amaning Elijah akoi hi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Laa 69:21</ref></char></note> Ankarra mi inkhat ataanna ponlom kha theiburju kuthur kha amiche-a luchei inkhat mor a akithil a, khana ria Jesu ner katung amajop nasik apeli aleiti, &lt;&lt;Ngaakdiri! Elijah ahonga ama cross ria akadom mata sik mi, enri!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Khana rasa kinringa a-onga Jesu kha athi jei.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Hon 26:31-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Bek-inna andong pon kha achung ria athoi kutung aher inni a akin ther je. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Khawa mun a cross mudon akingir raalmi lamkakei inkhat ning Jesu thidan kha aleimu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">thidan</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; alak manuscript a-om, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">rasa kinlaktak a a-onga khan athi je.</char></note> Amaning aleiti, &lt;&lt;Akidiktak a hiwa mipa hi Pathien Sapa e!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Lk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char>
    </note> Akalakdet ria alei ka-en numei alek anlei om. Ankarra khan Mary Magdalene, anaipa James le Joseph annu Mary, khana Salome ngai an e. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Anmani ning Jesu kha Galilee a aomlai anleijui khan anleisen. Khawa munna khan Jerusalem a ama le anhei kinroi numei katamtak num anlei om.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu thaanna anre</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43"/>Arimathea a Joseph ahong tung kha kholei teng a-e je. Amakha Pathien Rengram ahongtung sik alei kangaak, kaja ka-om upa rup karra inkhat e. Khawa kini kha kinrinni e (ti chu, Jehudi ngai Serni kini makma) khana Joseph ning kin-ngam tak a Pilate maikunga awase-a amadeng Jesu kulong kha aleini. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pilate ning Jesu athi jei ti aleijet phakhan aleingak. Raalmi lamkakeipa kha akoi-a Jesu thina asot mije tia alei rakal. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Raalmi lamkakeipa chong ajet so-a, Pilate ning Joseph deng Jesu kulong kha naleithei sik aleitipe. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Joseph ning ruipon kinnem neng arocho-a, akulong kha akadamthak a pon khaning akusun a lunga ankiwit thaan sunga aware jei. Khana lung kolok inkhat aminlet a thaan inkhar suokna kha aleikhar. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Mary Magdalene le Joseph nu Mary ning Jesu kulong anrena kha anleimu je.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Thei nokna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Jehudi Serni kini ator so-a, Mary Magdalene le James nu Mary khan Salome ngai Jesu kulong kunot nasik arim kahoi anlei rocho. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Maapning jingteng matak a, kini ahong suokpha anmani thaan teng anlei se. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3-4"/>Anmani lampui tonna ansena inkhat le inkhat ankin bek a, &lt;&lt;Thaankhar lungkha atuningmo ana iltot pesik?&gt;&gt; (Khawa kha lung kolok inkhat e.) Khan anmani ning an-inna lungkha alei kinlet kha anleimu. <verse eid="MRK 16:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Khan anmani ning thaan sunga alut a, pon kinchoul kabang kachek kinsil khangdong inkhat changteng panga akin-ong anleimu, khan anmani ning anlei kinlai.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>&lt;&lt;Kinlai muru,&gt;&gt; amaning aleiti. &lt;&lt;Nangni ning Nazareth Jesu cross a anmakhai kha nin entok keining kajet. Ama athei a, hin om-mak je! Enru, amaning ajalna kha hi e. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mk 14:28</ref></char></note> Atuntak se inlang hiwa chongkahoi hi ama thiemroi ngai le Peter deng warilru: &lt;Ama Galilee teng ninma a aleise je; nang nideng aleiril anga khawa mun a ninwamu sik.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Anmani ansuok a thaan ria aheitaan je, anchi le anratha kinnok ning asip je. Anmani anchi hei-a atukhat deng inkhatte ril muk je.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Jesu Mary Magdalene deng akinlar</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Jesu thina ria atheinok nuktenga, maapning kini matak a Mary Magdalene, asung ria khori sari aholsuok penu deng masatak akinlar. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Khawanu ning ase-a alei kinroipui asap ngaideng aleiril. Anmani anmulung leihoimak a anlei chap; <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>khana numeinu khaning Jesu aring amu-a arilpe ngaikha anjet inum anmani ning leitaksen muk.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ning anuk kujui inni deng akinlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Lk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Khan, Jesu ning ankarra miring inni deng ankho sena lampui a anselai alop det a alei kinlar. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Anmani ning anhei kirra mi alak deng anwaril pe, takkha anmani ning lei taksen muk.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu somle inkhat ngai deng akinlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sin 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Nuktenga, Jesu thiemroi somle inkhat ngai bu anbak lai alei kinlar. Anmanideng aleiren, ajarchu anmani taksenna neimuk khan anmulung anger rangra, ama aring jei tia akumu ngai chong kha taksen tor muk. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Sin 1:8</ref></char></note> Jesu ning anmanideng aleiti, &lt;&lt;Simleichung pumpui a se inlang khan chongkahoi hi miring rikip deng warilru. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Tu achang inum ataksen a baptized akatho mi kha hukminring achen sik; tu achang inum akataksen mak mi kha misetna achen sik. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Akataksen ngai kha hiwa sin kinlak thotor na ranak akinpe sik; anmani ning kei riming a khori ngai holsuok torna annei sik; anmani ning anjetngaimak chonglop anchong sik; <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>murul ngai ansura a-imakli tur an-in inum ite tinonung; mi akana ngai chunga ankut anda sik khana akana ngai kha andam sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu marwan akal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sin 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sin 1:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Puma Jesu ning anmanideng chong aril so pha, amakha marwan chungteng anroi a khan Pathien akut changteng akin-ong je. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Thiemroi ngai ning anse a amun rikip a chongkahoi anwaril, khan Puma ning anmani ngai kha akinroipui chak, khan antho sin kinlak ngai khaning anmani chongril kha adik tia amalar pe jei.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="ms">Alop amuro atorna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9-10 heading </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscripts alak a le amuro chongmalet a hiwa akabong torna Gosple achu akasei a antor (alam 9-20). </char></note></para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="MRK 16:9-10">16:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" pubnumber="9" sid="MRK 16:21"/> [Numeinu kha Peter le asap ngaideng ase a anmanideng aleikinti seng kha akabei a awamin jet. <verse eid="MRK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" pubnumber="10" sid="MRK 16:22"/> Khan, kumleiko hukminringna akintheng le akiring chak chongpui kha Jesu khet ning ama thiemroi ngaikha, niso teng ria taitak teng kutung aleimoso jei.]<verse eid="MRK 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
